(5280009, 767658, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nice way to get us to see a mundane scene anew.  Grain is a perfect complement to the "mysterious" look of the image.  Very compelling.</td>', 'Nice way to get us to see a mundane scene anew.  Grain is a perfect complement to the "mysterious" look of the image.  Very compelling.', '2009-03-01 00:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
