(5280029, 764177, 61651, '<td valign="top">What unusual-looking birds (unusual to me, at least) - I hope you can ID them in your photo notes, I''ll look forward to looking it up after the challenge.  What I find especially attractive in this image is how the angles of the birds and their head tufts echo the angles of the fence.</td>', 'What unusual-looking birds (unusual to me, at least) - I hope you can ID them in your photo notes, I''ll look forward to looking it up after the challenge.  What I find especially attractive in this image is how the angles of the birds and their head tufts echo the angles of the fence.', '2009-03-01 00:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280032, 767212, 61651, '<td valign="top">I bet this looks even more impressive full size, and would make a good print.  Love that sweep of surf.</td>', 'I bet this looks even more impressive full size, and would make a good print.  Love that sweep of surf.', '2009-03-01 00:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280034, 764665, 60173, '<td valign="top">I love the overall shapes and sense of pattern. There''s some pretty bad JPG jaggies left behind from the processing though.</td>', 'I love the overall shapes and sense of pattern. There''s some pretty bad JPG jaggies left behind from the processing though.', '2009-03-01 00:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
