(5280055, 762538, 60173, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I love everything except the pink hue, but that could just be because I hate pink.</td>', 'Great photo. I love everything except the pink hue, but that could just be because I hate pink.', '2009-03-01 00:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280056, 769210, 71244, '<td valign="top">Fantabulous shot. That would make anyone smile. Good luck for a top ranking, this shot deserves it!</td>', 'Fantabulous shot. That would make anyone smile. Good luck for a top ranking, this shot deserves it!', '2009-03-01 00:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280057, 768859, 71244, '<td valign="top">beautiful!</td>', 'beautiful!', '2009-03-01 00:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280058, 762717, 61651, '<td valign="top">This is mesmerizing, I suppose partly because of the fact that they are all close-eyed, and the odd posture of the one leaning backward, as if in a death repose.  Also the reflections - I suppose some might say you would be better off using a polarizer to get rid of the water reflections, but I like very much that you have them, and the image would be less absorbing to look at if they weren''t there.</td>', 'This is mesmerizing, I suppose partly because of the fact that they are all close-eyed, and the odd posture of the one leaning backward, as if in a death repose.  Also the reflections - I suppose some might say you would be better off using a polarizer to get rid of the water reflections, but I like very much that you have them, and the image would be less absorbing to look at if they weren''t there.', '2009-03-01 00:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280060, 769128, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nifty!  Well seen.</td>', 'Nifty!  Well seen.', '2009-03-01 00:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280061, 769210, 60173, '<td valign="top">Too cute, heh. I think the hand from above adds a great deal to the photo. It shows both scale and a reminder that there''s more to bath time than just a soapy baby. Bath time is often times an act of great tenderness and love between a parent and a child.<br/> <br/>Oh, and great tones, composition, and focus, heh.</td>', 'Too cute, heh. I think the hand from above adds a great deal to the photo. It shows both scale and a reminder that there''s more to bath time than just a soapy baby. Bath time is often times an act of great tenderness and love between a parent and a child. Oh, and great tones, composition, and focus, heh.', '2009-03-01 00:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280062, 766769, 71244, '<td valign="top">great expression and textures1</td>', 'great expression and textures1', '2009-03-01 00:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280063, 768992, 60173, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting. <br/> <br/>I wouldn''t have expected to see the highlight on the edge of the pupil like that. I''m still relatively new to fancy lighting, so is that normal? Was she wearing contacts that maybe caught the light?</td>', 'Wonderful lighting.  I wouldn''t have expected to see the highlight on the edge of the pupil like that. I''m still relatively new to fancy lighting, so is that normal? Was she wearing contacts that maybe caught the light?', '2009-03-01 00:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280064, 764971, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very eye-catching composition and color balance - nice!</td>', 'Very eye-catching composition and color balance - nice!', '2009-03-01 00:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280069, 769086, 63503, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and expression, textures are great too, I think it would gain a whole lot from added contrast and more light (in processing) to the face. I took the liberty of playing with it a little bit. Let me know after the challenge is over if you wish to see my sample edit.</td>', 'Very nice composition and expression, textures are great too, I think it would gain a whole lot from added contrast and more light (in processing) to the face. I took the liberty of playing with it a little bit. Let me know after the challenge is over if you wish to see my sample edit.', '2009-03-01 00:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280071, 768968, 63503, '<td valign="top">VERY pretty.</td>', 'VERY pretty.', '2009-03-01 00:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280075, 767758, 60173, '<td valign="top">I want to like this, I really do. That ripple in the reflection is really cool. The border is holding me back from getting in the photo. I normally am impartial to borders, but this one really is distracting.</td>', 'I want to like this, I really do. That ripple in the reflection is really cool. The border is holding me back from getting in the photo. I normally am impartial to borders, but this one really is distracting.', '2009-03-01 00:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
