(5280386, 769228, 37252, '<td valign="top">What a carefree and contagious smile. I like how the left arm/hand seems very naturally placed - not worrying if the hair gets messed up. The right arm/hand looks very stiff though in comparison. Aside from that and the lighting being a bit harsh, I like this image.</td>', 'What a carefree and contagious smile. I like how the left arm/hand seems very naturally placed - not worrying if the hair gets messed up. The right arm/hand looks very stiff though in comparison. Aside from that and the lighting being a bit harsh, I like this image.', '2009-03-01 05:30:48.000000', NULL, 1);
