(5280442, 769211, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''d like to say how much I like the photograph but I know who this gentleman is, so all I can feel when I look at it is anxiety.</td>', 'I''d like to say how much I like the photograph but I know who this gentleman is, so all I can feel when I look at it is anxiety.', '2009-03-01 06:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280443, 768818, 30364, '<td valign="top">It takes a lot to get me to like a photograph of flowers.  This is a lot.</td>', 'It takes a lot to get me to like a photograph of flowers.  This is a lot.', '2009-03-01 06:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280446, 769138, 92577, '<td valign="top">nice treatment</td>', 'nice treatment', '2009-03-01 06:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280447, 767503, 92577, '<td valign="top">arty and very nice</td>', 'arty and very nice', '2009-03-01 06:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280448, 769063, 30364, '<td valign="top">The light on his face, like a spotlight, transforms the girls in the window into a chorus line.  Now all we need is for cupid''s arrow to hit the passing lady, and we have a story!  There''s no business like show business.<br/>Terrific photograph.</td>', 'The light on his face, like a spotlight, transforms the girls in the window into a chorus line.  Now all we need is for cupid''s arrow to hit the passing lady, and we have a story!  There''s no business like show business.Terrific photograph.', '2009-03-01 06:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280449, 769193, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''d like to be indifferent to this (because it''s a bit corny) but I can''t do it; it is so beautifully done.  Nice work.</td>', 'I''d like to be indifferent to this (because it''s a bit corny) but I can''t do it; it is so beautifully done.  Nice work.', '2009-03-01 06:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280451, 769247, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well, I love horse photographs and take a lot myself, and I have found that some of the most radical crops/compositions are surprisingly effective.  You have too.  This is very powerful and, as your title suggests, engaging.</td>', 'Well, I love horse photographs and take a lot myself, and I have found that some of the most radical crops/compositions are surprisingly effective.  You have too.  This is very powerful and, as your title suggests, engaging.', '2009-03-01 06:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280452, 766967, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautifully simple in both conception and execution, and all the more effective for that restraint.  A high class portrait.</td>', 'Beautifully simple in both conception and execution, and all the more effective for that restraint.  A high class portrait.', '2009-03-01 06:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280453, 762717, 92577, '<td valign="top">priceless - I had to call people to look at it. Reminds me of our local council workforce! Must win - 10<br/>(I would say this has definite sales potential)</td>', 'priceless - I had to call people to look at it. Reminds me of our local council workforce! Must win - 10(I would say this has definite sales potential)', '2009-03-01 06:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280454, 768590, 92577, '<td valign="top">nice feel to it</td>', 'nice feel to it', '2009-03-01 06:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280456, 768169, 92577, '<td valign="top">far out!</td>', 'far out!', '2009-03-01 06:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280457, 769110, 92577, '<td valign="top">good stuff</td>', 'good stuff', '2009-03-01 06:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280458, 769232, 92577, '<td valign="top">great expression</td>', 'great expression', '2009-03-01 06:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280459, 767905, 30364, '<td valign="top">The repeating table motif with its attendant shadow play is arresting but it''s the implied story that retains the attention for longer ... why are all the other tables empty? yes it''s cold, but it''s late morning so there should be some coffee drinkers, surely?  and where is the other person from the occupied table?  taking the picture, perhaps?  but if so, why is the woman at the table not looking this way?   and what is she doing with her left leg?   It''s good fun, this picture.</td>', 'The repeating table motif with its attendant shadow play is arresting but it''s the implied story that retains the attention for longer ... why are all the other tables empty? yes it''s cold, but it''s late morning so there should be some coffee drinkers, surely?  and where is the other person from the occupied table?  taking the picture, perhaps?  but if so, why is the woman at the table not looking this way?   and what is she doing with her left leg?   It''s good fun, this picture.', '2009-03-01 06:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280463, 769242, 92577, '<td valign="top">feel the rush! (I''d go for a more deliberate tilt or straighten the horizon)</td>', 'feel the rush! (I''d go for a more deliberate tilt or straighten the horizon)', '2009-03-01 06:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280464, 769086, 92577, '<td valign="top">nice feel to it but I think there should be more light on her face</td>', 'nice feel to it but I think there should be more light on her face', '2009-03-01 07:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280466, 767658, 92577, '<td valign="top">groovy</td>', 'groovy', '2009-03-01 07:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280467, 765655, 30364, '<td valign="top">Well, that''s very fine.  Not the absolutely ideal form perhaps (nor is mine), but it''s certainly arresting.  I thought it was a piece of fruit from the thumb.  I''d say that it was a tongue-in-cheek work, but that might risk going from the sublime to the ridiculous. 8.</td>', 'Well, that''s very fine.  Not the absolutely ideal form perhaps (nor is mine), but it''s certainly arresting.  I thought it was a piece of fruit from the thumb.  I''d say that it was a tongue-in-cheek work, but that might risk going from the sublime to the ridiculous. 8.', '2009-03-01 07:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280468, 765764, 92577, '<td valign="top">good Harley pic</td>', 'good Harley pic', '2009-03-01 07:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280469, 765219, 92577, '<td valign="top">lovely</td>', 'lovely', '2009-03-01 07:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280470, 769218, 30364, '<td valign="top">I wish you had used a less expository title, because this could otherwise be so many things, all of which are more interesting than a bottle cap.   A strange illuminated sign.  A pleasingly incomprehensible art installation.  A vending machine selling the latest energy drink (Blue Bull, perhaps).  A bus stop shelter at the North Pole.  Lots more, all fun.  Are you quite sure it''s just a bottle cap?</td>', 'I wish you had used a less expository title, because this could otherwise be so many things, all of which are more interesting than a bottle cap.   A strange illuminated sign.  A pleasingly incomprehensible art installation.  A vending machine selling the latest energy drink (Blue Bull, perhaps).  A bus stop shelter at the North Pole.  Lots more, all fun.  Are you quite sure it''s just a bottle cap?', '2009-03-01 07:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280473, 769225, 79141, '<td valign="top">blue border is distracting</td>', 'blue border is distracting', '2009-03-01 07:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280476, 765283, 68956, '<td valign="top">A lovely portrait :)</td>', 'A lovely portrait :)', '2009-03-01 07:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280477, 769137, 68956, '<td valign="top">I love the muted colours in this one :)</td>', 'I love the muted colours in this one :)', '2009-03-01 07:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280479, 769233, 68956, '<td valign="top">A very beautiful model and a lovely portrait - one tiny nit pick, her lip make up looks asymmetrical.</td>', 'A very beautiful model and a lovely portrait - one tiny nit pick, her lip make up looks asymmetrical.', '2009-03-01 07:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280481, 765295, 30364, '<td valign="top">I hardly ever like photographs of flowers, but this is a ''hardly ever'' moment.  It''s no coincidence of course, that you chose the title you did.  For the same reason, this lily is also the symbol of the Easter Rising of  1916 in Ireland, celebrated in WB Yeats''s great poem of a ''terrible beauty''  <i>Easter 1916</i>:<br/>"... We know their dream; enough<br/>to know they dreamed and are dead.<br/>And what if excess of love<br/>bewildered them till they died?..."</td>', 'I hardly ever like photographs of flowers, but this is a ''hardly ever'' moment.  It''s no coincidence of course, that you chose the title you did.  For the same reason, this lily is also the symbol of the Easter Rising of  1916 in Ireland, celebrated in WB Yeats''s great poem of a ''terrible beauty''  Easter 1916:"... We know their dream; enoughto know they dreamed and are dead.And what if excess of lovebewildered them till they died?..."', '2009-03-01 07:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280482, 769141, 68956, '<td valign="top">Well I think this will turn out to be my favourite of the challenge, beautiful contrast between blur and sharpness - gives it a great sense of peace:)</td>', 'Well I think this will turn out to be my favourite of the challenge, beautiful contrast between blur and sharpness - gives it a great sense of peace:)', '2009-03-01 07:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280483, 769142, 68956, '<td valign="top">Very different and very effective, well done :)</td>', 'Very different and very effective, well done :)', '2009-03-01 07:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280485, 763841, 68956, '<td valign="top">They have positioned themselves so well for you, it''s made for a great shot :)</td>', 'They have positioned themselves so well for you, it''s made for a great shot :)', '2009-03-01 07:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280486, 768517, 68956, '<td valign="top">This is so good, I wasn''t sure if it was grass or trees coming in at the top - then I saw the tree ghosts in the windows. Great image, in my top three, well done :)</td>', 'This is so good, I wasn''t sure if it was grass or trees coming in at the top - then I saw the tree ghosts in the windows. Great image, in my top three, well done :)', '2009-03-01 07:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280487, 768762, 68956, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, it''s a shame that the guy has lost a bit of detail, but everything else is fantastic, well done :)</td>', 'Lovely image, it''s a shame that the guy has lost a bit of detail, but everything else is fantastic, well done :)', '2009-03-01 07:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280488, 769146, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s a lovely portrait with sublime lighting.  And he looks like a very nice gentleman, which is actually a tribute to both of you.</td>', 'It''s a lovely portrait with sublime lighting.  And he looks like a very nice gentleman, which is actually a tribute to both of you.', '2009-03-01 07:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280489, 769228, 41370, '<td valign="top">I would have given this a higher score if they box was not in the picture.  It is a beautiful portrait without the box.6</td>', 'I would have given this a higher score if they box was not in the picture.  It is a beautiful portrait without the box.6', '2009-03-01 07:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280490, 768892, 30364, '<td valign="top">This could be a <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=41746" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Gunnar</a> shot.  If it''s not, then you are as good as he is, in which case congratulations are in order.  I admire the capture of childish sentiment without the usual cloying sweetness.  It feels authentic.</td>', 'This could be a Gunnar shot.  If it''s not, then you are as good as he is, in which case congratulations are in order.  I admire the capture of childish sentiment without the usual cloying sweetness.  It feels authentic.', '2009-03-01 07:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
