(5281240, 768762, 62357, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment, voted earlier. I can''t put my finger on what it is I love about this image so much, but I do love it.  The colours are wonderful.  I love the peeking down looking at the man behind the desk.  The processing you have chosen gives it a painterly feel.  There are elements of this image that make me feel like I am looking at an Edward Hopper painting actually.  And that is always a good thing in my opinion.  Actually, just bumped it too.</td>', 'Coming back to comment, voted earlier. I can''t put my finger on what it is I love about this image so much, but I do love it.  The colours are wonderful.  I love the peeking down looking at the man behind the desk.  The processing you have chosen gives it a painterly feel.  There are elements of this image that make me feel like I am looking at an Edward Hopper painting actually.  And that is always a good thing in my opinion.  Actually, just bumped it too.', '2009-03-01 14:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
