(5281404, 768829, 96915, '<td valign="top">For some reason, my eyes want to go to the center structure in the water instead of to the couple.  I suspect it might be due to the heavy vignette.</td>', 'For some reason, my eyes want to go to the center structure in the water instead of to the couple.  I suspect it might be due to the heavy vignette.', '2009-03-01 15:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
