(5281580, 768169, 70514, '<td valign="top">That''s a title you don''t hear every day :)  Love the abstract feeling here, the strong diagonal line goes so well with the multitude of contrasting lines is quite cool.  Great use of lighting as well.</td>', 'That''s a title you don''t hear every day :)  Love the abstract feeling here, the strong diagonal line goes so well with the multitude of contrasting lines is quite cool.  Great use of lighting as well.', '2009-03-01 17:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
