(5281583, 768805, 70514, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot, love that you caught the guy before he totally falls.  Would''ve been great to have more focus on the scorer''s face, but I appreciate that''s a task not easily accomplished.</td>', 'Nice action shot, love that you caught the guy before he totally falls.  Would''ve been great to have more focus on the scorer''s face, but I appreciate that''s a task not easily accomplished.', '2009-03-01 17:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
