(5281619, 765283, 70514, '<td valign="top">Nice and relaxed portrait.  I feel more drawn to his lips than his eyes though.  May be the intention, but it''s a pull that does not seem very natural.</td>', 'Nice and relaxed portrait.  I feel more drawn to his lips than his eyes though.  May be the intention, but it''s a pull that does not seem very natural.', '2009-03-01 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5281620, 765561, 70514, '<td valign="top">Love it, seems asleep while not really.  Gorgeous b/w.</td>', 'Love it, seems asleep while not really.  Gorgeous b/w.', '2009-03-01 18:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5281625, 767852, 70514, '<td valign="top">Nice bubbles in the water, goes nicely with the egret, which is beautifully captured.</td>', 'Nice bubbles in the water, goes nicely with the egret, which is beautifully captured.', '2009-03-01 18:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5281626, 764953, 70514, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a picture in a book describing summer''s long past.  Beautiful colors and lighting.</td>', 'Reminds me of a picture in a book describing summer''s long past.  Beautiful colors and lighting.', '2009-03-01 18:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5281629, 768641, 70514, '<td valign="top">It''s wonderful that you captured the boys on the hill looking at the village, it really leads me through the image, telling a bit of a story, but leaving so much more to the imagination.</td>', 'It''s wonderful that you captured the boys on the hill looking at the village, it really leads me through the image, telling a bit of a story, but leaving so much more to the imagination.', '2009-03-01 18:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5281631, 766370, 70514, '<td valign="top">Great motion panning!</td>', 'Great motion panning!', '2009-03-01 18:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5281632, 768818, 70514, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sweet spot, and wonderful use of blur.  The duotone is gorgeous and really adds to the beauty of the roses.</td>', 'Beautiful sweet spot, and wonderful use of blur.  The duotone is gorgeous and really adds to the beauty of the roses.', '2009-03-01 18:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5281633, 769032, 40430, '<td valign="top">the simplicity works well here. good job</td>', 'the simplicity works well here. good job', '2009-03-01 18:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5281635, 768563, 70514, '<td valign="top">I wish the crop were a bit tighter with the pose, just seems to leave so much open space to roam a bit.</td>', 'I wish the crop were a bit tighter with the pose, just seems to leave so much open space to roam a bit.', '2009-03-01 18:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5281637, 765810, 70514, '<td valign="top">I hate fishing but love this image.  The wake in the water is so precise, the sky is gorgeous, so vast.  Beautiful.</td>', 'I hate fishing but love this image.  The wake in the water is so precise, the sky is gorgeous, so vast.  Beautiful.', '2009-03-01 18:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5281638, 767905, 70514, '<td valign="top">Love the repetition of the tables and chairs.  I really like this picture.</td>', 'Love the repetition of the tables and chairs.  I really like this picture.', '2009-03-01 18:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5281640, 768968, 70514, '<td valign="top">I wish the skin tone were less orange and a bit more light on her eyes to decrease the shadows.  Interesting image, nice composition and pose.</td>', 'I wish the skin tone were less orange and a bit more light on her eyes to decrease the shadows.  Interesting image, nice composition and pose.', '2009-03-01 18:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5281642, 768403, 70514, '<td valign="top">What a pretty puppy.  Just wish the pose were a bit different, or a tighter crop.</td>', 'What a pretty puppy.  Just wish the pose were a bit different, or a tighter crop.', '2009-03-01 18:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5281643, 769135, 19831, '<td valign="top">What a capture! Lovely. Nice lighting and very nice color tone here. Nice job on the exposure. The square crop works fine, I''m wondering though, if you tried a crop further to the right (placing subject more to left of frame), may strengthen the composition? maybe not :-) A great image though, nice job.</td>', 'What a capture! Lovely. Nice lighting and very nice color tone here. Nice job on the exposure. The square crop works fine, I''m wondering though, if you tried a crop further to the right (placing subject more to left of frame), may strengthen the composition? maybe not :-) A great image though, nice job.', '2009-03-01 18:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5281646, 768547, 70514, '<td valign="top">I really like this, it''s got a dream like quality that is hard to not love.  The bright water against the trees is just very pretty.</td>', 'I really like this, it''s got a dream like quality that is hard to not love.  The bright water against the trees is just very pretty.', '2009-03-01 18:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5281647, 768684, 32345, '<td valign="top">The white bar on the right is very distracting</td>', 'The white bar on the right is very distracting', '2009-03-01 18:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5281648, 769081, 70514, '<td valign="top">Is this a window display?  Almost looks like an overlay image, which is why I ask.  Love the composition, and the arrangement is quite interesting.  I really like it, makes an impression.</td>', 'Is this a window display?  Almost looks like an overlay image, which is why I ask.  Love the composition, and the arrangement is quite interesting.  I really like it, makes an impression.', '2009-03-01 18:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5281649, 768592, 19831, '<td valign="top">The crazy reflections in the window in the background are really cool, I like that! I guess I''m just not crazy about the heart thing as a subject in front of it.</td>', 'The crazy reflections in the window in the background are really cool, I like that! I guess I''m just not crazy about the heart thing as a subject in front of it.', '2009-03-01 18:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5281650, 768991, 70514, '<td valign="top">Very cute and wonderful idea.  Love the details and colors.  Lovely.</td>', 'Very cute and wonderful idea.  Love the details and colors.  Lovely.', '2009-03-01 18:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5281651, 769126, 70514, '<td valign="top">If this weren''t so cool it''d be funny.  It really does look a bit futuristic, and with that sign, it could be a bit intimidating.  Love the way you composed and processed this.  Just a hint of people makes it.</td>', 'If this weren''t so cool it''d be funny.  It really does look a bit futuristic, and with that sign, it could be a bit intimidating.  Love the way you composed and processed this.  Just a hint of people makes it.', '2009-03-01 18:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5281654, 765764, 70514, '<td valign="top">What a stud!  Love the attitude and pov.  Very cool!</td>', 'What a stud!  Love the attitude and pov.  Very cool!', '2009-03-01 18:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5281655, 765834, 19831, '<td valign="top">A very cool image. Great subject, and your processing, IMO, works well for it. Seeing the wee bit of dramatic sky, seeing the pure black in the rest of the sky area, especially in the upper left area, feels a little weird to me. Nice image, and I really like the wide angle.</td>', 'A very cool image. Great subject, and your processing, IMO, works well for it. Seeing the wee bit of dramatic sky, seeing the pure black in the rest of the sky area, especially in the upper left area, feels a little weird to me. Nice image, and I really like the wide angle.', '2009-03-01 18:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5281657, 768445, 40430, '<td valign="top">vivid color and great impact</td>', 'vivid color and great impact', '2009-03-01 18:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5281658, 765536, 70514, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful burst of color.  Lovely.</td>', 'What a beautiful burst of color.  Lovely.', '2009-03-01 18:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
