(5282064, 769083, 92512, '<td valign="top">Good use of color in a black and white</td>', 'Good use of color in a black and white', '2009-03-01 21:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282068, 769117, 99412, '<td valign="top">Nice old pickup.<br/>:)</td>', 'Nice old pickup.:)', '2009-03-01 21:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282076, 769132, 30791, '<td valign="top">Well that was easy enough to spot ;) <br/>Good luck Larus</td>', 'Well that was easy enough to spot ;) Good luck Larus', '2009-03-01 21:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282089, 766894, 99412, '<td valign="top">Wow. Underwater? In focus? Nice photo.<br/>Gotta give it a 10<br/>:)</td>', 'Wow. Underwater? In focus? Nice photo.Gotta give it a 10:)', '2009-03-01 21:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282105, 767340, 60698, '<td valign="top">Hahaha! Excellent and creative photo for the times we are facing. I can see this on the cover of a magazine!</td>', 'Hahaha! Excellent and creative photo for the times we are facing. I can see this on the cover of a magazine!', '2009-03-01 21:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282115, 769062, 60698, '<td valign="top">Even a photo of a common bird can be very special like this one is. Excellent! What a find! Simple background, focus and reflection are wonderful!</td>', 'Even a photo of a common bird can be very special like this one is. Excellent! What a find! Simple background, focus and reflection are wonderful!', '2009-03-01 21:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282120, 769110, 60698, '<td valign="top">Wow, looks like some real effort went into this photo! The whole thing is just perfectly done from photo to processing.</td>', 'Wow, looks like some real effort went into this photo! The whole thing is just perfectly done from photo to processing.', '2009-03-01 21:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282123, 768443, 60698, '<td valign="top">Hahahaha! Fabulous! This is a 10 from me and a fave!</td>', 'Hahahaha! Fabulous! This is a 10 from me and a fave!', '2009-03-01 21:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282128, 762717, 60698, '<td valign="top">They all look so peaceful and calm. This is a wonderful capture and a beautiful photo!</td>', 'They all look so peaceful and calm. This is a wonderful capture and a beautiful photo!', '2009-03-01 22:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282133, 768274, 60698, '<td valign="top">What a vision! Out of a dream... Nice!</td>', 'What a vision! Out of a dream... Nice!', '2009-03-01 22:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282144, 767729, 60698, '<td valign="top">This speaks to me. I love it!</td>', 'This speaks to me. I love it!', '2009-03-01 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282160, 769213, 81362, '<td valign="top">Peak of action, and play on "uneven" being the type of apparatue and the slight mismatch between the direction of the horizontal bar and the flag stripes. Makes a nice thumbnail preview too.</td>', 'Peak of action, and play on "uneven" being the type of apparatue and the slight mismatch between the direction of the horizontal bar and the flag stripes. Makes a nice thumbnail preview too.', '2009-03-01 22:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282162, 769146, 81362, '<td valign="top">Break the rule about not shooting portraits straight into squared shoulders and end up with a wonderfully direct character study. Enjoyable range of tones in this B&amp;W conversion. Hope you reveal more about your subject.</td>', 'Break the rule about not shooting portraits straight into squared shoulders and end up with a wonderfully direct character study. Enjoyable range of tones in this B&W conversion. Hope you reveal more about your subject.', '2009-03-01 22:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282167, 768087, 81362, '<td valign="top">The pose is dramatic and you have preserved details of the costume very well. The flames seem a bit washed out in competition with the saturated cyan of the sky. Wonder of selectively reducing cyan saturation a bit would allow the fire to stand out better.</td>', 'The pose is dramatic and you have preserved details of the costume very well. The flames seem a bit washed out in competition with the saturated cyan of the sky. Wonder of selectively reducing cyan saturation a bit would allow the fire to stand out better.', '2009-03-01 22:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282171, 768503, 81362, '<td valign="top">Compostion in the tradition of Anel Adams. I like how you captured the moon just over a dip in the cloud layer.</td>', 'Compostion in the tradition of Anel Adams. I like how you captured the moon just over a dip in the cloud layer.', '2009-03-01 22:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282174, 765784, 81362, '<td valign="top">Looks like a fun time. I would like to see the eyes sharper (many different ways to get there) and the background less cluttered (a step to the right might have removed the doorknob and doorjamb).</td>', 'Looks like a fun time. I would like to see the eyes sharper (many different ways to get there) and the background less cluttered (a step to the right might have removed the doorknob and doorjamb).', '2009-03-01 22:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282178, 769013, 81362, '<td valign="top">The hard metallic sharp edges, sharp and angular, contrast well with the softly curved organic shadows. Lots for the eye to enjoy here.</td>', 'The hard metallic sharp edges, sharp and angular, contrast well with the softly curved organic shadows. Lots for the eye to enjoy here.', '2009-03-01 22:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282184, 768751, 81362, '<td valign="top">Difficult exposure handled well, use of the diagonal nicely complimenting the pleats of the shirt. Excellent portrait.</td>', 'Difficult exposure handled well, use of the diagonal nicely complimenting the pleats of the shirt. Excellent portrait.', '2009-03-01 22:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282197, 765048, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of depth into the image. Depending on intent, this could have been a pretty nice oceanscape (wait a moment for the people to move out of the frame and get the horizon level - contrast of dark mass of rocks against medium tone of water and lighter tone of lighthouse and spit of land work well). Or move a bit to your left and closer to the water to have a study of the person in the water contrasted against the waves. Or let the swimmer move on and position yourself for a portrait of a red-hooded person with blue pants along the shore (maybe just in front of the rocks). Having all three themes makes the image weaker.</td>', 'Nice sense of depth into the image. Depending on intent, this could have been a pretty nice oceanscape (wait a moment for the people to move out of the frame and get the horizon level - contrast of dark mass of rocks against medium tone of water and lighter tone of lighthouse and spit of land work well). Or move a bit to your left and closer to the water to have a study of the person in the water contrasted against the waves. Or let the swimmer move on and position yourself for a portrait of a red-hooded person with blue pants along the shore (maybe just in front of the rocks). Having all three themes makes the image weaker.', '2009-03-01 22:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282205, 767321, 81362, '<td valign="top">Cute pose and sharp focus on the shirts. Could be stronger image if focus were moved to their eyes.</td>', 'Cute pose and sharp focus on the shirts. Could be stronger image if focus were moved to their eyes.', '2009-03-01 22:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282210, 765810, 81362, '<td valign="top">Love the ripples in "v" formation. Nice composition, even though that sky would certainly make me head for shore.</td>', 'Love the ripples in "v" formation. Nice composition, even though that sky would certainly make me head for shore.', '2009-03-01 22:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282220, 768169, 81362, '<td valign="top">Architecture transitioning into the abstract. Could be an illustration for a nightmare caused by watching too many accordians too closely. Well seen and well captured.</td>', 'Architecture transitioning into the abstract. Could be an illustration for a nightmare caused by watching too many accordians too closely. Well seen and well captured.', '2009-03-01 22:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282237, 768657, 81362, '<td valign="top">Great capture of light on the water. Having the repeating horizontal lines focused sharply up close then less sharp further away gives a powerful sense of the third dimension. Hope you let us know the location.</td>', 'Great capture of light on the water. Having the repeating horizontal lines focused sharply up close then less sharp further away gives a powerful sense of the third dimension. Hope you let us know the location.', '2009-03-01 22:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282260, 768967, 32736, '<td valign="top">I like it! Looks a bit fake with them posing so prettily, but the lighting and expressions do a lot for me. 9</td>', 'I like it! Looks a bit fake with them posing so prettily, but the lighting and expressions do a lot for me. 9', '2009-03-01 23:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282261, 769016, 32736, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Love the brightness and soft color. Would have been interesting to see this in the light on white challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful! Love the brightness and soft color. Would have been interesting to see this in the light on white challenge.', '2009-03-01 23:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282264, 768443, 32736, '<td valign="top">Very fun!!! Looks like quite the dogs :)</td>', 'Very fun!!! Looks like quite the dogs :)', '2009-03-01 23:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282267, 769075, 32736, '<td valign="top">Like the bird, would have liked to see more light, image may be to flat???</td>', 'Like the bird, would have liked to see more light, image may be to flat???', '2009-03-01 23:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282270, 764912, 32736, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, like the lighting and the eyes.<br/>The red in the background also gives this shot some interest.</td>', 'Nice portrait, like the lighting and the eyes.The red in the background also gives this shot some interest.', '2009-03-01 23:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282271, 768499, 32736, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see the focus on the birds.</td>', 'Would have liked to see the focus on the birds.', '2009-03-01 23:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282273, 765468, 32736, '<td valign="top">Beautiful location! The pink make this shot look a little artificial to me, maybe you could have gotten rid of the power poles?</td>', 'Beautiful location! The pink make this shot look a little artificial to me, maybe you could have gotten rid of the power poles?', '2009-03-01 23:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282276, 768726, 32736, '<td valign="top">Now put a pretty thing like  a flower or a person in the window and then you''d have something.</td>', 'Now put a pretty thing like  a flower or a person in the window and then you''d have something.', '2009-03-01 23:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282278, 765670, 32736, '<td valign="top">Very pretty! Almost story bookish.</td>', 'Very pretty! Almost story bookish.', '2009-03-01 23:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282279, 765769, 32736, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but I''d like to see some more light on the tulip.</td>', 'Good idea, but I''d like to see some more light on the tulip.', '2009-03-01 23:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282281, 769118, 32736, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection, need a better subject though.</td>', 'Nice reflection, need a better subject though.', '2009-03-01 23:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282284, 767246, 32736, '<td valign="top">Looks photo shopped, the hue of the sky is distracting for me.</td>', 'Looks photo shopped, the hue of the sky is distracting for me.', '2009-03-01 23:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282292, 768705, 15511, '<td valign="top">The extraordinary depth of the sky cannot compete with the unnatural brightness of the grass. The most interesting details are in the upper 60% of the image. I would have cropped this just above the gate.</td>', 'The extraordinary depth of the sky cannot compete with the unnatural brightness of the grass. The most interesting details are in the upper 60% of the image. I would have cropped this just above the gate.', '2009-03-01 23:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282300, 769012, 92512, '<td valign="top">Good work</td>', 'Good work', '2009-03-01 23:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282302, 769203, 92512, '<td valign="top">fine piece</td>', 'fine piece', '2009-03-01 23:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282304, 764443, 92512, '<td valign="top">very intense color I like it</td>', 'very intense color I like it', '2009-03-01 23:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282306, 767403, 15511, '<td valign="top">Good eye for a title!</td>', 'Good eye for a title!', '2009-03-01 23:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
