(5283112, 769023, 74979, '<td valign="top">beautiful tones feels peaceful and cold</td>', 'beautiful tones feels peaceful and cold', '2009-03-02 08:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283114, 766656, 74979, '<td valign="top">love the lighting on her fur''s design (tortoise shell?)</td>', 'love the lighting on her fur''s design (tortoise shell?)', '2009-03-02 08:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283115, 768711, 20748, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been better if your subject was on the back third of your image.</td>', 'I think it would have been better if your subject was on the back third of your image.', '2009-03-02 08:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283116, 768896, 14593, '<td valign="top">interesting concept here...very artsy</td>', 'interesting concept here...very artsy', '2009-03-02 08:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283118, 767877, 20748, '<td valign="top">Great name. I live in Hudson...</td>', 'Great name. I live in Hudson...', '2009-03-02 08:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283119, 765595, 74979, '<td valign="top">sweet bird capture..love that yellow to bring a splash of color!  nciely done</td>', 'sweet bird capture..love that yellow to bring a splash of color!  nciely done', '2009-03-02 08:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283126, 769138, 15711, '<td valign="top">What a majestic beast. You always wonder what they are thinking.</td>', 'What a majestic beast. You always wonder what they are thinking.', '2009-03-02 08:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283128, 768586, 15711, '<td valign="top">The flower is a touch bright, but it works as contrast to the fly''s darker reds and greens.  I might''ve burned the flower''s mid tones a bit, but the focus and the bokeh are spot on. :~)</td>', 'The flower is a touch bright, but it works as contrast to the fly''s darker reds and greens.  I might''ve burned the flower''s mid tones a bit, but the focus and the bokeh are spot on. :~)', '2009-03-02 08:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283132, 769006, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is good.  I think it might get lost in DPC''s love of macros and sunsets, but it stands on its own nicely. 7</td>', 'This is good.  I think it might get lost in DPC''s love of macros and sunsets, but it stands on its own nicely. 7', '2009-03-02 08:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283133, 768701, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh I love the hint of blue, which brings home the cold feel of this.  I wonder if it were in portrait mode and more of the foreground were included, if it would have worked better.  Probably not.  Just talking out loud.  To me, it seems slightly "chopped off" if that makes sense.  I love the line of the masts and the tonal range is really good.</td>', 'Oh I love the hint of blue, which brings home the cold feel of this.  I wonder if it were in portrait mode and more of the foreground were included, if it would have worked better.  Probably not.  Just talking out loud.  To me, it seems slightly "chopped off" if that makes sense.  I love the line of the masts and the tonal range is really good.', '2009-03-02 08:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283136, 768619, 15711, '<td valign="top">She is lovely.  I like the light but her expression seems a bit uncomfortable.  Her hair is really pretty and the slightly muted red works well in the scheme of the shot.</td>', 'She is lovely.  I like the light but her expression seems a bit uncomfortable.  Her hair is really pretty and the slightly muted red works well in the scheme of the shot.', '2009-03-02 08:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283140, 768771, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the "moment caught in time" feel of this.  I think what hurts it is that blurred something in the foreground.  You could crop it out and her movement would still ring true in the shot. Love the red sweater.</td>', 'I like the "moment caught in time" feel of this.  I think what hurts it is that blurred something in the foreground.  You could crop it out and her movement would still ring true in the shot. Love the red sweater.', '2009-03-02 08:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283141, 768169, 15711, '<td valign="top">Cool abstract!!!</td>', 'Cool abstract!!!', '2009-03-02 08:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283143, 767867, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the focus and composition.  If it were mine, I might adjust curves and/or layers to enrich the overall depth of color. Great focus.</td>', 'I like the focus and composition.  If it were mine, I might adjust curves and/or layers to enrich the overall depth of color. Great focus.', '2009-03-02 08:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283144, 769219, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL.  That is funny. Wonder if it would work better in BW.  It has so much going on with the different shapes and colors that my eye needs a place to rest.  Sometimes BW can neutralize that.  Maybe not. :~)</td>', 'ROFL.  That is funny. Wonder if it would work better in BW.  It has so much going on with the different shapes and colors that my eye needs a place to rest.  Sometimes BW can neutralize that.  Maybe not. :~)', '2009-03-02 08:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283145, 768574, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice HDR!! (wish there were some birds in that sky)  :~)</td>', 'Nice HDR!! (wish there were some birds in that sky)  :~)', '2009-03-02 08:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283146, 768013, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great lighting but her skin seems a touch flat, if that makes sense. Loving the catch lights in her eyes.  Green fingernails?  wow</td>', 'Great lighting but her skin seems a touch flat, if that makes sense. Loving the catch lights in her eyes.  Green fingernails?  wow', '2009-03-02 08:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283148, 768316, 15711, '<td valign="top">Good focus and composition but the blown out white sky hurts it a bit.</td>', 'Good focus and composition but the blown out white sky hurts it a bit.', '2009-03-02 08:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283149, 769217, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice honest portrait. I like the catch lights.  I might''ve cropped it more on the bottom, just below his chin. :~)</td>', 'Nice honest portrait. I like the catch lights.  I might''ve cropped it more on the bottom, just below his chin. :~)', '2009-03-02 08:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283150, 768805, 15711, '<td valign="top">That really is suspended animation. :~)</td>', 'That really is suspended animation. :~)', '2009-03-02 08:50:44.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5283152, 767730, 15711, '<td valign="top">Those binocular thingies always look like faces to me.  I like the composition.</td>', 'Those binocular thingies always look like faces to me.  I like the composition.', '2009-03-02 08:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283153, 767813, 20748, '<td valign="top">I think this has the potential to be a good landscape image. It looks like you took the time to mask out the back layer behind the valley for exposure but the overall blue cast seriously takes way from the image. Next time check your grey/white balance.</td>', 'I think this has the potential to be a good landscape image. It looks like you took the time to mask out the back layer behind the valley for exposure but the overall blue cast seriously takes way from the image. Next time check your grey/white balance.', '2009-03-02 08:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283154, 769112, 15711, '<td valign="top">Looks like a photo you''d see in a rose catalog.  What a lovely bloom.</td>', 'Looks like a photo you''d see in a rose catalog.  What a lovely bloom.', '2009-03-02 08:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283181, 769242, 74979, '<td valign="top">horizon being off hurts this a bit, otherwise I really like the abstract feel to the lovely beach!</td>', 'horizon being off hurts this a bit, otherwise I really like the abstract feel to the lovely beach!', '2009-03-02 09:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283182, 768904, 74979, '<td valign="top">lovely and so very well done! 10</td>', 'lovely and so very well done! 10', '2009-03-02 09:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283185, 768237, 74979, '<td valign="top">such a great timed image!  lovely landscape withe the surfer to add a real surprize!  9</td>', 'such a great timed image!  lovely landscape withe the surfer to add a real surprize!  9', '2009-03-02 09:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283186, 768776, 74979, '<td valign="top">wish he was as in focus as you nailed the board..good stop action</td>', 'wish he was as in focus as you nailed the board..good stop action', '2009-03-02 09:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283190, 769135, 102394, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot.  I love the simplicity of composition, but the detail of the subject.  Again, beautiful.</td>', 'What a beautiful shot.  I love the simplicity of composition, but the detail of the subject.  Again, beautiful.', '2009-03-02 09:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283192, 765969, 20748, '<td valign="top">HAHAHAHA. Just don''t get caught.</td>', 'HAHAHAHA. Just don''t get caught.', '2009-03-02 09:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283199, 765858, 20748, '<td valign="top">I saw your other shots on the forum. I think the eyes are a little hyper-realistic but other than that, great shot! Oh, and the boken is a little weird looking to me, maybe over sharpened?</td>', 'I saw your other shots on the forum. I think the eyes are a little hyper-realistic but other than that, great shot! Oh, and the boken is a little weird looking to me, maybe over sharpened?', '2009-03-02 09:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283212, 763997, 74979, '<td valign="top">a great surprise!..love the clarity of the lit phone booth and the night used as negative space..good for you!</td>', 'a great surprise!..love the clarity of the lit phone booth and the night used as negative space..good for you!', '2009-03-02 09:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
