(5283928, 762717, 84124, '<td valign="top">I''ve never been a big fan of animal shots on this site, but this one goes well beyond just a "look at the expression on that animal''s face" kind of composition.  You can sense the closeness of this family/pack.  The shallow DOF works well for this one as well.  Best I''ve seen thus far in this FS and certainly the best animal shot I recall seeing.</td>', 'I''ve never been a big fan of animal shots on this site, but this one goes well beyond just a "look at the expression on that animal''s face" kind of composition.  You can sense the closeness of this family/pack.  The shallow DOF works well for this one as well.  Best I''ve seen thus far in this FS and certainly the best animal shot I recall seeing.', '2009-03-02 13:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
