(5284222, 769015, 67258, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t have anything to do with a German GTG does it?  Looks remarkably like Mephisto - with a gorilla pod on his head.....  Probably one of the most bizarre portraits I have seen on DPC of late - nice one!</td>', 'This doesn''t have anything to do with a German GTG does it?  Looks remarkably like Mephisto - with a gorilla pod on his head.....  Probably one of the most bizarre portraits I have seen on DPC of late - nice one!', '2009-03-02 16:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
