(5284454, 768728, 70514, '<td valign="top">Eeek!  Amazing detail, love all the green and lines of the bug leading to his head.  Almost not so bad to see them like this versus in person!</td>', 'Eeek!  Amazing detail, love all the green and lines of the bug leading to his head.  Almost not so bad to see them like this versus in person!', '2009-03-02 18:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5284458, 763841, 60698, '<td valign="top">I adore cardinals!! Maybe because you always see them with their mate. This image is classic! What a find! Focus, bokeh, composition and color all natural and perfect. The wow factor to me is the snow falling dusting the male slightly and the female looking at us as if to say damn it''s cold! Great title too! :)</td>', 'I adore cardinals!! Maybe because you always see them with their mate. This image is classic! What a find! Focus, bokeh, composition and color all natural and perfect. The wow factor to me is the snow falling dusting the male slightly and the female looking at us as if to say damn it''s cold! Great title too! :)', '2009-03-02 18:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5284460, 768679, 70514, '<td valign="top">A lovely soft smile, which is contrasted a bit sadly with her hard working hands.  I like the colors and composition, and the wall adds a nice tone to the image.  (hope that makes sense)</td>', 'A lovely soft smile, which is contrasted a bit sadly with her hard working hands.  I like the colors and composition, and the wall adds a nice tone to the image.  (hope that makes sense)', '2009-03-02 18:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
