(5284463, 768964, 70514, '<td valign="top">What a lovely face, eyes and smile!  Fun composition to make the standard portrait a bit more fun and different.</td>', 'What a lovely face, eyes and smile!  Fun composition to make the standard portrait a bit more fun and different.', '2009-03-02 18:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
