(5286417, 763217, 31637, '<td valign="top">Awesome sephia look, and her pose is really nice, the leading lines direct you to her face which isn''t entirely in focus. The bottom half of the face is out of focus the most, would be ok of her eyes popped out a bit more, and only her hair seems sharp. It forces me to take a point away in this case, but I still give it a 7, it''s a really good portrait, could have ribboned.</td>', 'Awesome sephia look, and her pose is really nice, the leading lines direct you to her face which isn''t entirely in focus. The bottom half of the face is out of focus the most, would be ok of her eyes popped out a bit more, and only her hair seems sharp. It forces me to take a point away in this case, but I still give it a 7, it''s a really good portrait, could have ribboned.', '2009-03-03 21:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
