(5287253, 769219, 104505, '<td valign="top">Ahh, finally a wedding photo that brings delight instead of nausea. Marriage is never as airbrushed as we pretend on that day. But marriage can be and often is a goofy and confounded affair. Why do we get married? Well, because we get to be stupid and silly in front of each other. Candid. Kudos!<br/> <br/>As far as the saturated color and blown-out white- it totally works with this subject-matter representation. In this case, it''s not only tolerated but it is also welcomed! -Nadia</td>', 'Ahh, finally a wedding photo that brings delight instead of nausea. Marriage is never as airbrushed as we pretend on that day. But marriage can be and often is a goofy and confounded affair. Why do we get married? Well, because we get to be stupid and silly in front of each other. Candid. Kudos! As far as the saturated color and blown-out white- it totally works with this subject-matter representation. In this case, it''s not only tolerated but it is also welcomed! -Nadia', '2009-03-04 03:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
