(5287385, 769126, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.  I like how the straight lines and angles on the left juxtapose with the curves on the right.  It would be interesting to compare a color version to this photo, but I would say the B&amp;W keeps the viewer focused on the lines and curves.  Nice image.</td>', 'I like the composition.  I like how the straight lines and angles on the left juxtapose with the curves on the right.  It would be interesting to compare a color version to this photo, but I would say the B&W keeps the viewer focused on the lines and curves.  Nice image.', '2009-03-04 06:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
