(5287636, 769116, 58457, '<td valign="top">So the photo is pretty good, but I was confused by the title.  to be honest, I thought, is this supposed to make the photo better because there is a fancy way of spelling dancer?  So I looked it up... the three definitions I found day that danseur is a <i>male </i>ballet dancer.  I''m not scoring any differently because of the title, but I thought I''d let you know... good luck!</td>', 'So the photo is pretty good, but I was confused by the title.  to be honest, I thought, is this supposed to make the photo better because there is a fancy way of spelling dancer?  So I looked it up... the three definitions I found day that danseur is a male ballet dancer.  I''m not scoring any differently because of the title, but I thought I''d let you know... good luck!', '2009-03-04 09:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
