(5287780, 768317, 10867, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and the mood of this image, but I think that the purplish colorization has been counterproductive.  Plain black and white, or possibly a soft, tannish sepia would have been more effective, in my opinion.</td>', 'I like the subject and the mood of this image, but I think that the purplish colorization has been counterproductive.  Plain black and white, or possibly a soft, tannish sepia would have been more effective, in my opinion.', '2009-03-04 10:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
