(5288853, 769182, 58457, '<td valign="top">I don''t get your title.  I think if you are making a statement, you need more than just a straight architecture shot to do it--which is not to say that I have a feeling one way or the other, it just doesn''t really make sense to me.  Good luck.</td>', 'I don''t get your title.  I think if you are making a statement, you need more than just a straight architecture shot to do it--which is not to say that I have a feeling one way or the other, it just doesn''t really make sense to me.  Good luck.', '2009-03-04 14:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
