(5288893, 769100, 15495, '<td valign="top">love the processing...great colors.</td>', 'love the processing...great colors.', '2009-03-04 14:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289062, 768013, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very nice, though I feel you went overboard on pimping the eyes to the point where they look unnatural.</td>', 'Very nice, though I feel you went overboard on pimping the eyes to the point where they look unnatural.', '2009-03-04 15:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289075, 768238, 83313, '<td valign="top">A 36k file size tells me the main reason this shot isn''t working for me. There is a lack of clarity to this photo and I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. That compression is what is robbing a lot of the detail and sharpness from this image. I can see visible artifacts and halos around the edges between the white and red, but it is hurting the entire image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (200k for this one)</td>', 'A 36k file size tells me the main reason this shot isn''t working for me. There is a lack of clarity to this photo and I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. That compression is what is robbing a lot of the detail and sharpness from this image. I can see visible artifacts and halos around the edges between the white and red, but it is hurting the entire image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (200k for this one)', '2009-03-04 15:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5289085, 768400, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Love the tones of the metal. I''m not sure if this is HDR or if you just caught some excellent lighting. Most photos I have done of similar industrial facilities have been lacking, while this is the kind of shot I have envisioned when I take them. Hope you left some good notes in your remarks block. A fave for this one.</td>', 'Nicely done. Love the tones of the metal. I''m not sure if this is HDR or if you just caught some excellent lighting. Most photos I have done of similar industrial facilities have been lacking, while this is the kind of shot I have envisioned when I take them. Hope you left some good notes in your remarks block. A fave for this one.', '2009-03-04 15:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
