(5290396, 767048, 96915, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors.  The background on the left seems too bright and doesn''t really fit with the rest of the image.</td>', 'Very nice colors.  The background on the left seems too bright and doesn''t really fit with the rest of the image.', '2009-03-05 02:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290398, 768762, 96915, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic!  Excellent composition.</td>', 'This is fantastic!  Excellent composition.', '2009-03-05 02:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290400, 767222, 96915, '<td valign="top">Great energy and beautiful dancer.  It''s really too bad that her hand is cut off on the top of the frame.  Hands are just as important in this style of dance as the hips are.</td>', 'Great energy and beautiful dancer.  It''s really too bad that her hand is cut off on the top of the frame.  Hands are just as important in this style of dance as the hips are.', '2009-03-05 02:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290404, 768680, 96915, '<td valign="top">The path does a nice job of leading the eye into the image.  The street lights seem just too bright for the rest of the image.</td>', 'The path does a nice job of leading the eye into the image.  The street lights seem just too bright for the rest of the image.', '2009-03-05 02:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290409, 765447, 96915, '<td valign="top">The lighting (looks like on-camera flash) just doesn''t work here.  It leaves some shadows while also appearing very flat.  There''s also a yellow cast over the image, more than just the yellow subject matter.</td>', 'The lighting (looks like on-camera flash) just doesn''t work here.  It leaves some shadows while also appearing very flat.  There''s also a yellow cast over the image, more than just the yellow subject matter.', '2009-03-05 02:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290414, 769240, 96915, '<td valign="top">I kind of like the coloring here.  Not sure if it was intentional, it kind of looks like a painting.  The subject though just doesn''t pull me in.  The building itself is not very eye-catching.</td>', 'I kind of like the coloring here.  Not sure if it was intentional, it kind of looks like a painting.  The subject though just doesn''t pull me in.  The building itself is not very eye-catching.', '2009-03-05 02:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290428, 769033, 66398, '<td valign="top">without claws?? lol. Very nice shot. Great lighting! Colors are vivid but not overdone. Looks like a portrait shot except with a wonderful caught in action expression. Great job. I''m not voting but if I were I''d give it a 10</td>', 'without claws?? lol. Very nice shot. Great lighting! Colors are vivid but not overdone. Looks like a portrait shot except with a wonderful caught in action expression. Great job. I''m not voting but if I were I''d give it a 10', '2009-03-05 02:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290490, 768745, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s graphically very pleasing, this shot.  All those lovely horizontal layers.  So even if you view it from too far away to be sure what it is, it still looks interesting.</td>', 'It''s graphically very pleasing, this shot.  All those lovely horizontal layers.  So even if you view it from too far away to be sure what it is, it still looks interesting.', '2009-03-05 06:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290491, 769177, 30364, '<td valign="top">I see a very nice landscape-in-progress here (maybe because I have some minor background in cartography).  It''s an immensely pleasing effect and a most original image, at least in the context of this Challenge.</td>', 'I see a very nice landscape-in-progress here (maybe because I have some minor background in cartography).  It''s an immensely pleasing effect and a most original image, at least in the context of this Challenge.', '2009-03-05 06:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290494, 765560, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is nice; very simple and yet all the more striking for that lack of pretension.  I know that sounds contradictory, or counterintuitive or something like that, but what I''m trying to say is that I admire the fact that you have not tried to impose the photographer on the photograph by reaching for some more ''artistic'' execution of it, both during and after the exposure.  It''s a level of restraint that we could all profit from emulating.</td>', 'This is nice; very simple and yet all the more striking for that lack of pretension.  I know that sounds contradictory, or counterintuitive or something like that, but what I''m trying to say is that I admire the fact that you have not tried to impose the photographer on the photograph by reaching for some more ''artistic'' execution of it, both during and after the exposure.  It''s a level of restraint that we could all profit from emulating.', '2009-03-05 06:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290495, 769015, 30364, '<td valign="top">I nearly always like portraits with eyes closed ... the good ones seem to liberate the subject, and give the viewer so much more scope for imagination.  This is a good one.</td>', 'I nearly always like portraits with eyes closed ... the good ones seem to liberate the subject, and give the viewer so much more scope for imagination.  This is a good one.', '2009-03-05 06:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290501, 768924, 30364, '<td valign="top">Such an unusual sentiment to brand your skin with ... presumably it''s a declaration of affection, punctuated by an armpit; very classy.  It''s a nicely-made photograph although of no apparent substance beyond that.</td>', 'Such an unusual sentiment to brand your skin with ... presumably it''s a declaration of affection, punctuated by an armpit; very classy.  It''s a nicely-made photograph although of no apparent substance beyond that.', '2009-03-05 06:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290503, 769032, 30364, '<td valign="top">Quite beautiful.  This grass looks a bit like the hair of a scruffy dog, but if I push that idea aside it''s a lovely atmospheric image.</td>', 'Quite beautiful.  This grass looks a bit like the hair of a scruffy dog, but if I push that idea aside it''s a lovely atmospheric image.', '2009-03-05 06:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290504, 768726, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for window shots.  The light at windows is nearly always wonderful.  Like this.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for window shots.  The light at windows is nearly always wonderful.  Like this.', '2009-03-05 06:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290506, 769139, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is nearly beautiful.  There''s something discordant, and I think it''s the top of the iron gate.  Otherwise the light and the shapes are lovely.  I don''t suppose it was practical to remove the gate however.  Pity.</td>', 'This is nearly beautiful.  There''s something discordant, and I think it''s the top of the iron gate.  Otherwise the light and the shapes are lovely.  I don''t suppose it was practical to remove the gate however.  Pity.', '2009-03-05 06:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290524, 769189, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is very compelling.   Literally it''s a root system I think; certainly some part of a plant.  But it suggests something else entirely.  It promises, it hints, but it is ultimately just slightly out of reach.   <i>Birth</i> is a good start, but not the whole story.</td>', 'This is very compelling.   Literally it''s a root system I think; certainly some part of a plant.  But it suggests something else entirely.  It promises, it hints, but it is ultimately just slightly out of reach.   Birth is a good start, but not the whole story.', '2009-03-05 06:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290530, 768407, 30364, '<td valign="top">A lovely wee visual <i>bon mot</i> that tests the limits of photography (to say nothing of the limits of the voters here).  9.</td>', 'A lovely wee visual bon mot that tests the limits of photography (to say nothing of the limits of the voters here).  9.', '2009-03-05 06:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290536, 768867, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a portrait of a pretty girl done with some sensitivity and imagination for a change. 8.</td>', 'Nice to see a portrait of a pretty girl done with some sensitivity and imagination for a change. 8.', '2009-03-05 07:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290537, 766656, 30364, '<td valign="top">That''s a super-duper cat shot!  So much more character than the ''formal'' cat portraits we see so many of.</td>', 'That''s a super-duper cat shot!  So much more character than the ''formal'' cat portraits we see so many of.', '2009-03-05 07:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290556, 765858, 73981, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. The only thing that bugs me is that he stands out too much from the background...almost like he''s in front of a poster. Perhaps a higher exposure on the backdrop of this would have given it that extra edge IMO. Still, wonderful shot, wonderful editing to the model.</td>', 'Great portrait. The only thing that bugs me is that he stands out too much from the background...almost like he''s in front of a poster. Perhaps a higher exposure on the backdrop of this would have given it that extra edge IMO. Still, wonderful shot, wonderful editing to the model.', '2009-03-05 07:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290564, 762717, 73981, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photo...I would love to head up to Nagano right about now for a shot like this. The monkey on the right sleeping is just so great. 10 from me, and a fav at that.</td>', 'This is a wonderful photo...I would love to head up to Nagano right about now for a shot like this. The monkey on the right sleeping is just so great. 10 from me, and a fav at that.', '2009-03-05 07:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290567, 769142, 30364, '<td valign="top">Yes.  Very nicely observed.  Interesting how much more powerful this is with the presence of <i>two</i> figures.  Imagine it with just either one ... it''d be nothing like as good.  I think it''s because the two make some kind of implied dialogue.  9.</td>', 'Yes.  Very nicely observed.  Interesting how much more powerful this is with the presence of two figures.  Imagine it with just either one ... it''d be nothing like as good.  I think it''s because the two make some kind of implied dialogue.  9.', '2009-03-05 07:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290571, 767048, 30364, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a flower shot with some ambition to it.  This is good.</td>', 'Nice to see a flower shot with some ambition to it.  This is good.', '2009-03-05 07:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290594, 767169, 22459, '<td valign="top">great image, well spotted.</td>', 'great image, well spotted.', '2009-03-05 07:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290745, 768968, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is just too weird not to love. I see it as a gorilla with a woman''s head in a birch forest.</td>', 'This is just too weird not to love. I see it as a gorilla with a woman''s head in a birch forest.', '2009-03-05 09:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290796, 768326, 61961, '<td valign="top">I like the effect of the back stream showing through the front stream -- it''s a good variation on the ubiquitous water drop miniatures.  The top half of the photo is less successful.  Those yellow plastic spouts are terribly ugly, even when blurred.  Tapered watering can spouts would be better, and glass or some other more photogenic material would be even better.</td>', 'I like the effect of the back stream showing through the front stream -- it''s a good variation on the ubiquitous water drop miniatures.  The top half of the photo is less successful.  Those yellow plastic spouts are terribly ugly, even when blurred.  Tapered watering can spouts would be better, and glass or some other more photogenic material would be even better.', '2009-03-05 10:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
