(5290923, 769233, 83313, '<td valign="top">Great eyes. Sharp, but NOT overprocessed and unnatural looking. In spite of the monotone treatment, her lips appear red and moist. Good job all around, but the wow is in the details with this one. I aspire do being able to do portraits like this someday.</td>', 'Great eyes. Sharp, but NOT overprocessed and unnatural looking. In spite of the monotone treatment, her lips appear red and moist. Good job all around, but the wow is in the details with this one. I aspire do being able to do portraits like this someday.', '2009-03-05 11:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
