(5290935, 769003, 83313, '<td valign="top">I hate to leave a comment of "interesting", because to me that says someone disliked it but still wanted to say something nice. However, it IS interesting. Makes me wonder what is beyond this post that I am being warned about.</td>', 'I hate to leave a comment of "interesting", because to me that says someone disliked it but still wanted to say something nice. However, it IS interesting. Makes me wonder what is beyond this post that I am being warned about.', '2009-03-05 11:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
