(5290952, 768742, 83313, '<td valign="top">A tad soft. Your 57k file size tells me why. Much of it may be due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. It is robbing a lot of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (200k for this one)</td>', 'A tad soft. Your 57k file size tells me why. Much of it may be due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. It is robbing a lot of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (200k for this one)', '2009-03-05 11:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5290954, 769063, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure what the story is here, but there seems to be one implied.</td>', 'Not quite sure what the story is here, but there seems to be one implied.', '2009-03-05 11:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
