(5291143, 769224, 99394, '<td valign="top">The fur in the ears and the edge of the coat look like they may be a little too sharp? Not quite sure what it is that''s making it look a little off. Nothing major though :) Nice shot.</td>', 'The fur in the ears and the edge of the coat look like they may be a little too sharp? Not quite sure what it is that''s making it look a little off. Nothing major though :) Nice shot.', '2009-03-05 13:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
