(5291655, 765283, 100106, '<td valign="top">Well done! Your lighting is great here. Nice and soft. His expression is amazing. Just seems as though his eyes tell the story. Also I like your focus here. How it''s right on is face and everything else doesn''t matter. 8</td>', 'Well done! Your lighting is great here. Nice and soft. His expression is amazing. Just seems as though his eyes tell the story. Also I like your focus here. How it''s right on is face and everything else doesn''t matter. 8', '2009-03-05 18:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291659, 769142, 100106, '<td valign="top">I like your idea behind this photo.What I like is how it appears that someone is peering in to gaze upon something they admire and or love, but can''t get to. All the while, life moves on behind you. Love the amount of sat you chose and how well you captured the textures of the walls. Well done. 8</td>', 'I like your idea behind this photo.What I like is how it appears that someone is peering in to gaze upon something they admire and or love, but can''t get to. All the while, life moves on behind you. Love the amount of sat you chose and how well you captured the textures of the walls. Well done. 8', '2009-03-05 18:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291661, 769246, 100106, '<td valign="top">Powerful image to me. Looks as though it was a perfect day for this shot. Your sharpness within the smoke is spot on and love how it lifts into the sky where it blends. Also, good choice on BW and to me, nothing else in the photo is destracting. The two stacks just screamed at me when your photo popped up (in a good way). 8</td>', 'Powerful image to me. Looks as though it was a perfect day for this shot. Your sharpness within the smoke is spot on and love how it lifts into the sky where it blends. Also, good choice on BW and to me, nothing else in the photo is destracting. The two stacks just screamed at me when your photo popped up (in a good way). 8', '2009-03-05 18:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291675, 763089, 100106, '<td valign="top">Good DoF - color is good - nice and sharp - interesting compositon. 7</td>', 'Good DoF - color is good - nice and sharp - interesting compositon. 7', '2009-03-05 18:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291683, 768655, 100106, '<td valign="top">It''s nice to see people working with light painting. IMO - you did an amzing job with this concept. The choice of red here is excellent. I''m glad to see the light coming from the bottom where the light started. Love how it does that on its own. Plus, the glass gives it alignment until it reaches the top where it flows natrually. Good choice on the border as well. 10</td>', 'It''s nice to see people working with light painting. IMO - you did an amzing job with this concept. The choice of red here is excellent. I''m glad to see the light coming from the bottom where the light started. Love how it does that on its own. Plus, the glass gives it alignment until it reaches the top where it flows natrually. Good choice on the border as well. 10', '2009-03-05 18:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291684, 769073, 100106, '<td valign="top">Great DoF. It works well for me. Its sharp and has good color but not over saturated. 7</td>', 'Great DoF. It works well for me. Its sharp and has good color but not over saturated. 7', '2009-03-05 18:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291693, 768629, 100106, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. My frist thought was..."What terrible thing did he do?" But, after looking at it for a bit, he could have done something good. Finsihed operating and such. I like how it doesn''t give the answer. It makes you think and find what you want too find within it. <br/> <br/>Like the choice of lighting here, makes it look as though it''s in an inclosed area that''s dark. The only nit pick would be the lighting on his left arm. 8</td>', 'Interesting photo. My frist thought was..."What terrible thing did he do?" But, after looking at it for a bit, he could have done something good. Finsihed operating and such. I like how it doesn''t give the answer. It makes you think and find what you want too find within it.  Like the choice of lighting here, makes it look as though it''s in an inclosed area that''s dark. The only nit pick would be the lighting on his left arm. 8', '2009-03-05 19:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291709, 767340, 100106, '<td valign="top">Hats off to your models here. Good costumes and experssions. I found a little humor here with their actions. It brought a little light into something that can be so dark. I like how you decided to keep the BG black. It keeps your subjects in your face. The only thing I could suggest would be a bit softer light on the front end (hand/arm and coin). All around - well done. 8</td>', 'Hats off to your models here. Good costumes and experssions. I found a little humor here with their actions. It brought a little light into something that can be so dark. I like how you decided to keep the BG black. It keeps your subjects in your face. The only thing I could suggest would be a bit softer light on the front end (hand/arm and coin). All around - well done. 8', '2009-03-05 19:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291716, 768728, 92512, '<td valign="top">Holy smoke.  What a great micro.  The face and the antennae are especially sharp.</td>', 'Holy smoke.  What a great micro.  The face and the antennae are especially sharp.', '2009-03-05 19:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291718, 768829, 92512, '<td valign="top">I normally don''t like the dark frames around the picture but in this one looks reputed.  It seems to work  well with this sky.</td>', 'I normally don''t like the dark frames around the picture but in this one looks reputed.  It seems to work  well with this sky.', '2009-03-05 19:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291722, 769242, 92512, '<td valign="top">I feel like I''m being sucked into this photo.  I love this guy in the photo is real, brilliant.</td>', 'I feel like I''m being sucked into this photo.  I love this guy in the photo is real, brilliant.', '2009-03-05 19:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291723, 764177, 100106, '<td valign="top">This pic to me is simple in a good way. The fence is a great subject and the birds are great additions. Nicely lit, like the DoF, good color and focus. Nicely done. 7</td>', 'This pic to me is simple in a good way. The fence is a great subject and the birds are great additions. Nicely lit, like the DoF, good color and focus. Nicely done. 7', '2009-03-05 19:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291726, 769190, 92512, '<td valign="top">Nice greenhouse effect.  I''m not sure what the little blue things are what they work well.</td>', 'Nice greenhouse effect.  I''m not sure what the little blue things are what they work well.', '2009-03-05 19:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291729, 769196, 92512, '<td valign="top">Nice micro-.  The lighting on the strawberry works well, makes me want to just take a great big bite of it.</td>', 'Nice micro-.  The lighting on the strawberry works well, makes me want to just take a great big bite of it.', '2009-03-05 19:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291734, 768966, 92512, '<td valign="top">The lighting works well here.  The cards just seem  to be blazing off into the sunset.</td>', 'The lighting works well here.  The cards just seem  to be blazing off into the sunset.', '2009-03-05 19:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291735, 768987, 92512, '<td valign="top">Nice picture of the sunset.  I wish I could tell more of what was walking in the woods toward me.  Only if you could highlight these figures here a little better.  Somehow.  Still a very good shot.</td>', 'Nice picture of the sunset.  I wish I could tell more of what was walking in the woods toward me.  Only if you could highlight these figures here a little better.  Somehow.  Still a very good shot.', '2009-03-05 19:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291736, 769232, 92512, '<td valign="top">I''m really liking these pictures of the wolves.  You have really captured some great action.  The black-and-white works well here.</td>', 'I''m really liking these pictures of the wolves.  You have really captured some great action.  The black-and-white works well here.', '2009-03-05 19:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291739, 766658, 92512, '<td valign="top">Yes the darkened edges really does create a dream state to this photo in it really works real well.</td>', 'Yes the darkened edges really does create a dream state to this photo in it really works real well.', '2009-03-05 19:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291741, 767340, 92512, '<td valign="top">This photo may become a reality before long.  Your models deserve a hand further great participation.</td>', 'This photo may become a reality before long.  Your models deserve a hand further great participation.', '2009-03-05 19:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291747, 769089, 92512, '<td valign="top">This one seems a little fuzzy to me, blurry.  It probably would have looked better without the black frame around it.  I still like the sky it is very intense.</td>', 'This one seems a little fuzzy to me, blurry.  It probably would have looked better without the black frame around it.  I still like the sky it is very intense.', '2009-03-05 19:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
