(5291826, 768949, 108564, '<td valign="top">Pelicans are the best!  I love the clouds behind him.  I think the large box or whatever it is tends to be a bit distracting though.</td>', 'Pelicans are the best!  I love the clouds behind him.  I think the large box or whatever it is tends to be a bit distracting though.', '2009-03-05 20:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291828, 768652, 92512, '<td valign="top">The orange colored chairs adds contrast to the girl''s eyes and dress, making them stand out.  The chairs also add design and balance to the photo.</td>', 'The orange colored chairs adds contrast to the girl''s eyes and dress, making them stand out.  The chairs also add design and balance to the photo.', '2009-03-05 20:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291830, 768814, 108564, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors - - I''ve just seen this shot too many times on this site.  But for what it is, it is one of the better ones that I''ve seen.</td>', 'I really like the colors - - I''ve just seen this shot too many times on this site.  But for what it is, it is one of the better ones that I''ve seen.', '2009-03-05 20:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291831, 769128, 92512, '<td valign="top">Very interesting work here.  I''m not sure what you have done, but it looks good.  Nice swirly design also.</td>', 'Very interesting work here.  I''m not sure what you have done, but it looks good.  Nice swirly design also.', '2009-03-05 20:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291833, 768737, 108564, '<td valign="top">What a fabulous location!  Love the trees and your use of the sun in the shot.  The only problem I see is that the reflection off the water in the background is distracting from the bride''s dress.  I would have liked to see the dress brighter in the shot to balance it out.</td>', 'What a fabulous location!  Love the trees and your use of the sun in the shot.  The only problem I see is that the reflection off the water in the background is distracting from the bride''s dress.  I would have liked to see the dress brighter in the shot to balance it out.', '2009-03-05 20:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291834, 764288, 108564, '<td valign="top">great color!</td>', 'great color!', '2009-03-05 20:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291836, 769074, 92512, '<td valign="top">Very good macro, great detail of the face.</td>', 'Very good macro, great detail of the face.', '2009-03-05 20:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5291837, 769135, 108564, '<td valign="top">What a fabulous moment!!!  He looks positively human!  Hey, I think he looks like my grandpa :) 10 all the way and if you don''t place, just know that you should have!</td>', 'What a fabulous moment!!!  He looks positively human!  Hey, I think he looks like my grandpa :) 10 all the way and if you don''t place, just know that you should have!', '2009-03-05 20:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
