(5293057, 768316, 100106, '<td valign="top">Nice! Not a bird person, but have to say...this is fantastic. He or she seems sinister and I like that. The way you captured the feathers, him/her and the branch makes me see that. Plus the eye is just hard staring at me. Hands down a solid 10 in my book.<br/> <br/>Back again - after looking at your photo again, the beak also does a number on me. Adding to my favs and if you don''t put this up on DPC Prints - PM me if you''re interested in selling a copy.</td>', 'Nice! Not a bird person, but have to say...this is fantastic. He or she seems sinister and I like that. The way you captured the feathers, him/her and the branch makes me see that. Plus the eye is just hard staring at me. Hands down a solid 10 in my book. Back again - after looking at your photo again, the beak also does a number on me. Adding to my favs and if you don''t put this up on DPC Prints - PM me if you''re interested in selling a copy.', '2009-03-06 15:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
