(5293349, 768808, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s a fun picture. Small thing--I find the slight tilt to the floor distracting. I think since the line goes all the way across, it might have been better to straighten that and have the top of the picture a little wonky. I''m not sure...<br/> <br/>Also, I think it would be stronger without the vignette in the corners. <br/> <br/>It''s a great idea, and a nice shot.</td>', 'It''s a fun picture. Small thing--I find the slight tilt to the floor distracting. I think since the line goes all the way across, it might have been better to straighten that and have the top of the picture a little wonky. I''m not sure... Also, I think it would be stronger without the vignette in the corners.  It''s a great idea, and a nice shot.', '2009-03-06 19:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293351, 768392, 103142, '<td valign="top">nice shot. cropped in a bit close, however. You cut off of the flowers on the top and the hands on the bottom such a small amount, it doesn''t seem like you did it on purpose, just by accident.</td>', 'nice shot. cropped in a bit close, however. You cut off of the flowers on the top and the hands on the bottom such a small amount, it doesn''t seem like you did it on purpose, just by accident.', '2009-03-06 20:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
