(5293492, 767126, 82985, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful--great subtle pastel feel.  A crop from the right so that only the petals are in frame (eliminating the background) might enhance this even more.  7</td>', 'This is wonderful--great subtle pastel feel.  A crop from the right so that only the petals are in frame (eliminating the background) might enhance this even more.  7', '2009-03-06 22:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293495, 767110, 82985, '<td valign="top">Do you?  <i>Do you REALLY?!</i> <br/> <br/>I bet you say that to <i>all</i> the voters.....</td>', 'Do you?  Do you REALLY?!  I bet you say that to all the voters.....', '2009-03-06 22:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293496, 765769, 82985, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image--well composed and well seen.  It is a bit dark--not the shadows, which are "lovely, dark, and deep",  but on the flower petals: a bit more brightness could make this strong image really sing.  On my monitor, which tends to be too bright already, these petals fall in the "middle grey" range, and a zone or two brighter there would be helpful--but don''t lose that wonderful texture in them.<br/> <br/>There is also a little bright bit at the leaf/stem joint that could do with a quick "heal" out.<br/> <br/>Or, ignore me completely!  It is your image &amp; vision.  <br/> <br/>So, back to the main point: I really like this image! 7</td>', 'This is a beautiful image--well composed and well seen.  It is a bit dark--not the shadows, which are "lovely, dark, and deep",  but on the flower petals: a bit more brightness could make this strong image really sing.  On my monitor, which tends to be too bright already, these petals fall in the "middle grey" range, and a zone or two brighter there would be helpful--but don''t lose that wonderful texture in them. There is also a little bright bit at the leaf/stem joint that could do with a quick "heal" out. Or, ignore me completely!  It is your image & vision.   So, back to the main point: I really like this image! 7', '2009-03-06 22:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293498, 769058, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and expression.</td>', 'Great lighting and expression.', '2009-03-06 22:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293499, 767730, 82985, '<td valign="top">but, is it chicken or fish?  :-)  Jessica S. will need clarification.<br/> <br/>nicely done  7</td>', 'but, is it chicken or fish?  :-)  Jessica S. will need clarification. nicely done  7', '2009-03-06 22:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
