(5293594, 765764, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great angle! I think I would have cropped slightly tighter on all sides but the bottom to emphasize the face a little more (alghough then you might lose the framing of the bike, which is key). Nice shot.</td>', 'Great angle! I think I would have cropped slightly tighter on all sides but the bottom to emphasize the face a little more (alghough then you might lose the framing of the bike, which is key). Nice shot.', '2009-03-06 22:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5293598, 768605, 88204, '<td valign="top">Center composition works well. Painting in the background is slightly distracting. All the other background element seem to work fine. Those are some big pipes! I think my ideal for this shot would be to crop tighter with a black background to really emphasize the pipes and the expression. Well done.</td>', 'Center composition works well. Painting in the background is slightly distracting. All the other background element seem to work fine. Those are some big pipes! I think my ideal for this shot would be to crop tighter with a black background to really emphasize the pipes and the expression. Well done.', '2009-03-06 22:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
