(5293618, 769146, 88204, '<td valign="top">Ooh... I love it! Beautiful lighting. Great character in the face. I''m hoping this is your father and we could include it in a father series (read about the idea on the image below)<br/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=748404" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/960/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_748404.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/960/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_748404.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/960/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_748404.jpg"/></a> <br/>I haven''t figured out how we''ll pull the series together on the site but I''d love to get more people to contribute. (If it isn''t your father, it''s still a great shot. One of my favorites in the challenge.)</td>', 'Ooh... I love it! Beautiful lighting. Great character in the face. I''m hoping this is your father and we could include it in a father series (read about the idea on the image below)  I haven''t figured out how we''ll pull the series together on the site but I''d love to get more people to contribute. (If it isn''t your father, it''s still a great shot. One of my favorites in the challenge.)', '2009-03-06 22:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
