(5294171, 768237, 42100, '<td valign="top">This one is quite subtle in the sense that that you didn''t go for those easy, "wow" sunset/sunrise colors...the beauty in this really lies in the quality of detail, contrast and the strong composition.  Beautiful photo!</td>', 'This one is quite subtle in the sense that that you didn''t go for those easy, "wow" sunset/sunrise colors...the beauty in this really lies in the quality of detail, contrast and the strong composition.  Beautiful photo!', '2009-03-07 11:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
