(5294192, 768994, 42100, '<td valign="top">The vignette really serves this scene well, it forces the eye in nicely on this moody dusk and makes the viewer much more involved.</td>', 'The vignette really serves this scene well, it forces the eye in nicely on this moody dusk and makes the viewer much more involved.', '2009-03-07 11:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294194, 768732, 42100, '<td valign="top">You really could spend hours exploring the details of this scene, but at the same time you can take a step back and not be overwhelmed by the complexities of this scene.  Great tones here as well!</td>', 'You really could spend hours exploring the details of this scene, but at the same time you can take a step back and not be overwhelmed by the complexities of this scene.  Great tones here as well!', '2009-03-07 11:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294198, 766970, 42100, '<td valign="top">Duck photos can be a dime a dozen, but you took this four or five levels beyond with this great environmental setting.  It''s now much more of a story in pixels with all the interest and details...well done!</td>', 'Duck photos can be a dime a dozen, but you took this four or five levels beyond with this great environmental setting.  It''s now much more of a story in pixels with all the interest and details...well done!', '2009-03-07 11:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294206, 768503, 42013, '<td valign="top">Richard I presume? Great capture of the elements.</td>', 'Richard I presume? Great capture of the elements.', '2009-03-07 12:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294231, 766959, 54540, '<td valign="top">Wow - this would have been a great fit for the recent "Action" challenge!  Well captured, love it.</td>', 'Wow - this would have been a great fit for the recent "Action" challenge!  Well captured, love it.', '2009-03-07 12:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294236, 764899, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very cool and would be a perfect motivational poster. <br/> <br/>There used to be a disabled woman in my local bike club that rode a hand cranked trike. She showed up on a lot of rides and was quite inspiring to me. I would not have wanted to arm wrestle with her!<br/> <br/>This is one of those shots where strong personal appeal for me is going to get you an exceptionally high vote and a fave. (Huh?! There''s no "12" button, what a ripoff!)</td>', 'Very cool and would be a perfect motivational poster.  There used to be a disabled woman in my local bike club that rode a hand cranked trike. She showed up on a lot of rides and was quite inspiring to me. I would not have wanted to arm wrestle with her! This is one of those shots where strong personal appeal for me is going to get you an exceptionally high vote and a fave. (Huh?! There''s no "12" button, what a ripoff!)', '2009-03-07 12:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294237, 765784, 83313, '<td valign="top">Where did you find the duck bill? My daughter is collecting duck stuff and she would love one of those!<br/> <br/>The photo is humorous, but I''m afraid it just comes off as a snapshot to me. A closer portrait type shot of the person wearing the duck bill would probably be great. Some levels and curves adjustment to help bump up the contrast and colors could also give this a visual boost.</td>', 'Where did you find the duck bill? My daughter is collecting duck stuff and she would love one of those! The photo is humorous, but I''m afraid it just comes off as a snapshot to me. A closer portrait type shot of the person wearing the duck bill would probably be great. Some levels and curves adjustment to help bump up the contrast and colors could also give this a visual boost.', '2009-03-07 12:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294238, 768760, 83313, '<td valign="top">Is this the Adamus sharpening method that has recently been discussed in the forums? I''m trying to figure out how to effectively do this technique in PaintShop Pro.</td>', 'Is this the Adamus sharpening method that has recently been discussed in the forums? I''m trying to figure out how to effectively do this technique in PaintShop Pro.', '2009-03-07 12:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294244, 766909, 62187, '<td valign="top">Looks a lot like an unconventional side challenge? Or maybe I''ve just been smoking too much dog-bane hemp! It''s a lovely image not matter what...</td>', 'Looks a lot like an unconventional side challenge? Or maybe I''ve just been smoking too much dog-bane hemp! It''s a lovely image not matter what...', '2009-03-07 13:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294278, 769083, 62187, '<td valign="top">That was the BEST movie ever! And this is a great representation of it!</td>', 'That was the BEST movie ever! And this is a great representation of it!', '2009-03-07 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294289, 765097, 62187, '<td valign="top">WALL-E was the best ever!</td>', 'WALL-E was the best ever!', '2009-03-07 14:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
