(5294328, 768805, 67237, '<td valign="top">too bad you did not entered this to the action challenge. I think it would had done great. The guy on the left (coach?) makes the shot. Very good journalism action photo...7</td>', 'too bad you did not entered this to the action challenge. I think it would had done great. The guy on the left (coach?) makes the shot. Very good journalism action photo...7', '2009-03-07 14:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294330, 765813, 63812, '<td valign="top">This a peaceful landscape. Smooth, soft,very  beautiful!</td>', 'This a peaceful landscape. Smooth, soft,very  beautiful!', '2009-03-07 14:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294332, 768605, 61961, '<td valign="top">Looking good, Coley.  Can''t wait to see your skin shot! :-D</td>', 'Looking good, Coley.  Can''t wait to see your skin shot! :-D', '2009-03-07 14:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294334, 768442, 63812, '<td valign="top">certainly "delicato" . Great image</td>', 'certainly "delicato" . Great image', '2009-03-07 14:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294336, 768510, 61961, '<td valign="top">Nice water exposure, just the right amount of time.  The yellow spot in the sky seems off, like an unnatural color variation created in post-processing.</td>', 'Nice water exposure, just the right amount of time.  The yellow spot in the sky seems off, like an unnatural color variation created in post-processing.', '2009-03-07 14:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294339, 766370, 67237, '<td valign="top">very nice panning</td>', 'very nice panning', '2009-03-07 14:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294343, 767501, 67237, '<td valign="top">strong photo</td>', 'strong photo', '2009-03-07 14:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294362, 763217, 82985, '<td valign="top">beautifully done--obviously a beautiful subject, but in addition you have a great pose, beautiful lighting, and you made use of the textures in the sweater to guide the eye without overpowering the image.  The tones, conversion are wonderful,  Her eyes, skin, hair are just wonderfully done.<br/> <br/>some might question the long strand of hair, but I think it is great: it echos the line of her outer arm, and continues the leading line from her lower arm--whether it is fortuitous and you kept it, or you saw a need and went over and pulled a strand down, kudos to you--either way, a great decision.<br/> <br/>9</td>', 'beautifully done--obviously a beautiful subject, but in addition you have a great pose, beautiful lighting, and you made use of the textures in the sweater to guide the eye without overpowering the image.  The tones, conversion are wonderful,  Her eyes, skin, hair are just wonderfully done. some might question the long strand of hair, but I think it is great: it echos the line of her outer arm, and continues the leading line from her lower arm--whether it is fortuitous and you kept it, or you saw a need and went over and pulled a strand down, kudos to you--either way, a great decision. 9', '2009-03-07 15:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294364, 768944, 82985, '<td valign="top">I am a total sucker for these sorts of images, and often attempt them myself (with substantially less success).  There seems to be a little zig-zag artifacting happenin, either from the sharpening, resizing, or something.  The tones and conversion are wonderful and luminous.  I like the lines, composition very much. 9</td>', 'I am a total sucker for these sorts of images, and often attempt them myself (with substantially less success).  There seems to be a little zig-zag artifacting happenin, either from the sharpening, resizing, or something.  The tones and conversion are wonderful and luminous.  I like the lines, composition very much. 9', '2009-03-07 15:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294371, 765729, 82985, '<td valign="top">I love this sort of image!  This is so well done, with the bold lined, deep shadows, tack sharp texture, and luminous conversion.  I might crop in from the left just slightly, just enough to remove the highlighted sliver of area in the lower left, or maybe burn it down a bit.  Or I might not.  9</td>', 'I love this sort of image!  This is so well done, with the bold lined, deep shadows, tack sharp texture, and luminous conversion.  I might crop in from the left just slightly, just enough to remove the highlighted sliver of area in the lower left, or maybe burn it down a bit.  Or I might not.  9', '2009-03-07 15:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294378, 768904, 82985, '<td valign="top">well done, beautiful soft lighting and great pose, composition.  8</td>', 'well done, beautiful soft lighting and great pose, composition.  8', '2009-03-07 15:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294392, 769100, 82985, '<td valign="top">Wow.  There is so much right with this image, too long to list.  Might be easier to point out a couple of flaws.  Except there aren''t any! Leading lines, both bold and subtle, guide the eye effortlessly. She is luminous, both in her own lighting, and perfectly backlit where necessary.  The tones are perfect, and you have managed to make brown water beautiful.  I think the formal photographic terminology here is "Now, that''s just showing off!"<br/> <br/>question: what is the vertical thing she appears to be holding?  I want to say it is a riding crop, but that would be a tad kinky, right?  Not that there is anything wrong with that :-)<br/> <br/>9</td>', 'Wow.  There is so much right with this image, too long to list.  Might be easier to point out a couple of flaws.  Except there aren''t any! Leading lines, both bold and subtle, guide the eye effortlessly. She is luminous, both in her own lighting, and perfectly backlit where necessary.  The tones are perfect, and you have managed to make brown water beautiful.  I think the formal photographic terminology here is "Now, that''s just showing off!" question: what is the vertical thing she appears to be holding?  I want to say it is a riding crop, but that would be a tad kinky, right?  Not that there is anything wrong with that :-) 9', '2009-03-07 15:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294395, 769084, 82985, '<td valign="top">this drew an audible gasp from me :-) 10</td>', 'this drew an audible gasp from me :-) 10', '2009-03-07 15:42:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5294397, 763953, 82985, '<td valign="top">So very well done: Imposing, dramatic, tones/textures are spot on and tack sharp. 10</td>', 'So very well done: Imposing, dramatic, tones/textures are spot on and tack sharp. 10', '2009-03-07 15:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294406, 768701, 74979, '<td valign="top">lovely scene, tones suit the image very well, can feel the brrr<br/> <br/>(if there were colorful Christmas lights hung down the boat''s lines, it would be an awesome Christmas card)</td>', 'lovely scene, tones suit the image very well, can feel the brrr (if there were colorful Christmas lights hung down the boat''s lines, it would be an awesome Christmas card)', '2009-03-07 15:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294407, 769146, 82985, '<td valign="top">but mischievous and humorous, with sparklng shining eyes and a warmth that you <i>captured</i> here, using your skills to show us this about him, rather than fabricate it with with technique and lighting.  Portraiture has the added obstacle that the person is a stranger: many portraits are technically perfect, but no real connection is made.  This portrait reveals and presents charisma, chemistry, appeal.  I want to know what he is thinking at this moment, what he would say if he could suddenly start speaking right from this image.<br/> <br/>You already know that the technicals here are perfect, from the conversion, lighting, tones, dof--clear expertise is evident here.  <br/> <br/>10</td>', 'but mischievous and humorous, with sparklng shining eyes and a warmth that you captured here, using your skills to show us this about him, rather than fabricate it with with technique and lighting.  Portraiture has the added obstacle that the person is a stranger: many portraits are technically perfect, but no real connection is made.  This portrait reveals and presents charisma, chemistry, appeal.  I want to know what he is thinking at this moment, what he would say if he could suddenly start speaking right from this image. You already know that the technicals here are perfect, from the conversion, lighting, tones, dof--clear expertise is evident here.   10', '2009-03-07 15:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294408, 769210, 82985, '<td valign="top">This may well be the best "baby" pic I have ever seen.  And the conversion makes it extraordinary (in color I suspect it is still "cute" but the b/w treatment here transcends that).  This is luminous in so many varied ways.  10</td>', 'This may well be the best "baby" pic I have ever seen.  And the conversion makes it extraordinary (in color I suspect it is still "cute" but the b/w treatment here transcends that).  This is luminous in so many varied ways.  10', '2009-03-07 15:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294409, 762717, 82985, '<td valign="top">okay--back to bump this to 10.<br/> <br/>This is peaceful, haunting, profound, cute, intriguing all at once.<br/> <br/>I appreciate your processing here--just enough to create the mood and feeling without overdoing anything.  <br/> <br/>Extraordinary</td>', 'okay--back to bump this to 10. This is peaceful, haunting, profound, cute, intriguing all at once. I appreciate your processing here--just enough to create the mood and feeling without overdoing anything.   Extraordinary', '2009-03-07 15:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294410, 764126, 82985, '<td valign="top">OH, this is Fantastic: it has that natural, lazy, carefree Saturday afternoon feel to it.  Beautiful conversion, great texture, tonality, and the eyes are stunning without seeming over-manipulated.  10</td>', 'OH, this is Fantastic: it has that natural, lazy, carefree Saturday afternoon feel to it.  Beautiful conversion, great texture, tonality, and the eyes are stunning without seeming over-manipulated.  10', '2009-03-07 15:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5294411, 769148, 82985, '<td valign="top">Wonderful--the image is flawless, and this is a case where the title enhances it perfectly. well done! <strike>9</strike>  bumping to 10.  kid ambushed ME!</td>', 'Wonderful--the image is flawless, and this is a case where the title enhances it perfectly. well done! 9  bumping to 10.  kid ambushed ME!', '2009-03-07 15:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
