(5294680, 768814, 100106, '<td valign="top">I like this image. At first glance, the middle drop caught my eye. I like the colors chosen for the drops. What I wonder is if you did a tighter crop on the purple drop, what you would get. It''s sitting so perfectly above the ripple. Also, (my .o2 which doesn''t mean jack) the background seems to show through a bit much for me. Hence the thought of a tighter crop. Your focus is spot on. I like how you were able to capture the base of the ripples along with the top drop also bring in focus. Overall, nice work! 7</td>', 'I like this image. At first glance, the middle drop caught my eye. I like the colors chosen for the drops. What I wonder is if you did a tighter crop on the purple drop, what you would get. It''s sitting so perfectly above the ripple. Also, (my .o2 which doesn''t mean jack) the background seems to show through a bit much for me. Hence the thought of a tighter crop. Your focus is spot on. I like how you were able to capture the base of the ripples along with the top drop also bring in focus. Overall, nice work! 7', '2009-03-07 19:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
