(5294843, 768596, 100106, '<td valign="top">At first glance, my eye went on him. Then wondered whay he was looking up at and there was the surprise. I like that how that worked. The DoF is really nice. Smooth and not destracting at all. Focus is great and it''s cool how the image inside the glass is upside down. 8</td>', 'At first glance, my eye went on him. Then wondered whay he was looking up at and there was the surprise. I like that how that worked. The DoF is really nice. Smooth and not destracting at all. Focus is great and it''s cool how the image inside the glass is upside down. 8', '2009-03-07 21:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
