(5295191, 769233, 83313, '<td valign="top">Should have been a 6+, IMO. Maybe not enough in your face wow factor for that. But you still got a nice high score out of this. Freestudies are harshly voted. Adding this to my faves.</td>', 'Should have been a 6+, IMO. Maybe not enough in your face wow factor for that. But you still got a nice high score out of this. Freestudies are harshly voted. Adding this to my faves.', '2009-03-08 00:09:10.000000', NULL, 0),
