(5295210, 768728, 44877, '<td valign="top">Wow, Roz - this macro is incredible. The detail and DOF are outstanding. Not to mention the pose you captured. You must have a super steady hand and a lot of patience. Congrats on your great placement. OX</td>', 'Wow, Roz - this macro is incredible. The detail and DOF are outstanding. Not to mention the pose you captured. You must have a super steady hand and a lot of patience. Congrats on your great placement. OX', '2009-03-08 00:17:31.000000', NULL, 0),
