(5295228, 769234, 83313, '<td valign="top">Didn''t come up for me in voting. Most sports shots seem like snapshots, which they usually are. Don''t know if you did anything special here, or if you just lucked into some fantastic lighting. This appears to have been taken during a game, but it is a great in-action portrait. I expect you are getting quite a reputation around your school for swinging a lens.</td>', 'Didn''t come up for me in voting. Most sports shots seem like snapshots, which they usually are. Don''t know if you did anything special here, or if you just lucked into some fantastic lighting. This appears to have been taken during a game, but it is a great in-action portrait. I expect you are getting quite a reputation around your school for swinging a lens.', '2009-03-08 00:23:20.000000', NULL, 0),
