(5295237, 768758, 47852, '<td valign="top">This was my favorite shot from the challenge... abstract, unique, with subtle complementary colors, a wonderful dof to create a sense of depth and the stopped motion... this is a beautiful capture of an every day event.  Just like the title says.  Thanks for sharing this one! :)</td>', 'This was my favorite shot from the challenge... abstract, unique, with subtle complementary colors, a wonderful dof to create a sense of depth and the stopped motion... this is a beautiful capture of an every day event.  Just like the title says.  Thanks for sharing this one! :)', '2009-03-08 00:26:01.000000', NULL, 0),
