(5295299, 768892, 64670, '<td valign="top">Splendid image.</td>', 'Splendid image.', '2009-03-08 00:51:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295300, 769141, 64670, '<td valign="top">Amazing capture.</td>', 'Amazing capture.', '2009-03-08 00:52:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295302, 769135, 64670, '<td valign="top">Great pose.</td>', 'Great pose.', '2009-03-08 00:52:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295303, 769125, 71244, '<td valign="top">I am so pleased that some thought this was a Coley, and I will admit being inspired by the work, but I think my image is not as symbolic as those. I had the wings for a different set up (with a black horse) in the snow and on a whim asked my son to pose...just in case. Good thing because the wings on the black horse failed, as we have some "kinks" to work out. Need a new pair of wings now as the ones on the horse lasted about 30 seconds...maybe I can borrow some from Coley!</td>', 'I am so pleased that some thought this was a Coley, and I will admit being inspired by the work, but I think my image is not as symbolic as those. I had the wings for a different set up (with a black horse) in the snow and on a whim asked my son to pose...just in case. Good thing because the wings on the black horse failed, as we have some "kinks" to work out. Need a new pair of wings now as the ones on the horse lasted about 30 seconds...maybe I can borrow some from Coley!', '2009-03-08 00:53:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295304, 769103, 83313, '<td valign="top">Of course, I had to skip the vote on your entry, knowing it was yours. I do have to leave my usual critique however. Your 84k file size indicates you may have some excessive JPEG compression taking away some of the detail and clarity. Always save with as little compression as you can and still sneak in under the challenge limit. You had a lot more overhead with this one.</td>', 'Of course, I had to skip the vote on your entry, knowing it was yours. I do have to leave my usual critique however. Your 84k file size indicates you may have some excessive JPEG compression taking away some of the detail and clarity. Always save with as little compression as you can and still sneak in under the challenge limit. You had a lot more overhead with this one.', '2009-03-08 00:54:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295305, 768892, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''m sick of you now.  You''re so last month.<br/> <br/>- only kidding, I still love ya.</td>', 'I''m sick of you now.  You''re so last month. - only kidding, I still love ya.', '2009-03-08 00:55:22.000000', NULL, 0),
