(5295310, 768417, 12250, '<td valign="top">My first dabble with HDR didn''t go too well.  Tried to capture the houses at dusk with little light.  It was a 6 second shutter speed.  You can see the front porch lights were on a few of the houses.  I think a clearer day would''ve helped also.  There were dark clouds coming in.<br/> <br/>It''s not the south mountain area in AZ.  It''s in the Fallbrook area of Southern CA.</td>', 'My first dabble with HDR didn''t go too well.  Tried to capture the houses at dusk with little light.  It was a 6 second shutter speed.  You can see the front porch lights were on a few of the houses.  I think a clearer day would''ve helped also.  There were dark clouds coming in. It''s not the south mountain area in AZ.  It''s in the Fallbrook area of Southern CA.', '2009-03-08 00:59:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295312, 769015, 83313, '<td valign="top">What are you doing way down here, woman!? Definitely an odd one. I can see why it came in where it did, but you appealed to <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30364" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Ubique</a>, which is not easy to do.<br/> <br/>I will not even guess what I might have voted it, because it did not come up for me. I am pleased to see you entering what you like, however. It''s a way more interesting photo than my train!</td>', 'What are you doing way down here, woman!? Definitely an odd one. I can see why it came in where it did, but you appealed to  Ubique, which is not easy to do. I will not even guess what I might have voted it, because it did not come up for me. I am pleased to see you entering what you like, however. It''s a way more interesting photo than my train!', '2009-03-08 01:00:17.000000', NULL, 0),
