(5295326, 769081, 83313, '<td valign="top">Darn. I was expecting this one to create a little controversy over the implied message. A low score is better if it comes with great comments. It was a good effort and idea though. <br/> <br/>For anyone interested, here''s what I thought of it when Brian asked my input:<br/> <br/><i>It makes a strong point about attitudes changing. What was once a casual nick-nack is now considered racially offensive stereotyping. I think it could (and will) convey two different messages to different people. The first is that people were thoughtless and insensitive many years ago and we are now better than that. The second way is that we are now overly sensitive and spend too much time walking on eggshells worrying that we might offend someone. Two sides of the same coin.<br/> <br/>I''d like to see you enter it. You may get some offended comments and low votes because of the subject, but I think it will also get the attention of the folks for whom a pretty picture is not enough and they want a photo to speak to them. You''ll probably clean up on the comments.<br/></i> <br/></td>', 'Darn. I was expecting this one to create a little controversy over the implied message. A low score is better if it comes with great comments. It was a good effort and idea though.  For anyone interested, here''s what I thought of it when Brian asked my input: It makes a strong point about attitudes changing. What was once a casual nick-nack is now considered racially offensive stereotyping. I think it could (and will) convey two different messages to different people. The first is that people were thoughtless and insensitive many years ago and we are now better than that. The second way is that we are now overly sensitive and spend too much time walking on eggshells worrying that we might offend someone. Two sides of the same coin. I''d like to see you enter it. You may get some offended comments and low votes because of the subject, but I think it will also get the attention of the folks for whom a pretty picture is not enough and they want a photo to speak to them. You''ll probably clean up on the comments. ', '2009-03-08 01:08:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295327, 764126, 30982, '<td valign="top">You got a 7 from me - love the look!  (And of course love it in B&amp;W).  Cute kids always do well.  :)  And congrats on the new entry in your top row - that''s two in one week!  (I show 7 across, so your Puzzled is in there, too.)</td>', 'You got a 7 from me - love the look!  (And of course love it in B&W).  Cute kids always do well.  :)  And congrats on the new entry in your top row - that''s two in one week!  (I show 7 across, so your Puzzled is in there, too.)', '2009-03-08 01:09:30.000000', NULL, 0),
