(5295419, 768346, 99263, '<td valign="top">Congratz on the 9th place. Heck....so it was taken in South Africa as well. What a coincidence. When I placed my comment during voting I had no idea that it was in South Africa yet it reminded me of the times I spent fishing there in places such as this.<br/>I used to live in Witsand at the mouth of the Breede river and that strech of coastline looks just like this and I was often to be found there fishing at low tide just like the fisherman in your image.<br/>Now live in Holland but boy do I get homesick some times.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-03-08 05:11:07.</i></td>', 'Congratz on the 9th place. Heck....so it was taken in South Africa as well. What a coincidence. When I placed my comment during voting I had no idea that it was in South Africa yet it reminded me of the times I spent fishing there in places such as this.I used to live in Witsand at the mouth of the Breede river and that strech of coastline looks just like this and I was often to be found there fishing at low tide just like the fisherman in your image.Now live in Holland but boy do I get homesick some times.', '2009-03-08 05:08:33.000000', '2009-03-08 05:11:07.000000', 0),
