(5295427, 768443, 99263, '<td valign="top">This was definite top 3 entry for me. I see that there are people that pass out ones on  many really great images. The site council should really make a law that requires anyone to explain any score below 3. Failing to do so should result in penalties and eventually banning.</td>', 'This was definite top 3 entry for me. I see that there are people that pass out ones on  many really great images. The site council should really make a law that requires anyone to explain any score below 3. Failing to do so should result in penalties and eventually banning.', '2009-03-08 05:35:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295429, 768867, 100646, '<td valign="top">just my oppinion, but I think this would have done a bit better had it been in black and white. I like the composition a lot, and the lighting is good.</td>', 'just my oppinion, but I think this would have done a bit better had it been in black and white. I like the composition a lot, and the lighting is good.', '2009-03-08 05:43:00.000000', NULL, 0),
