(5295525, 768957, 46168, '<td valign="top">I love this and gave it a high mark!! It should have had a higher finish IMHO.  Good job, as always.</td>', 'I love this and gave it a high mark!! It should have had a higher finish IMHO.  Good job, as always.', '2009-03-08 08:58:54.000000', NULL, 0),
