(5295531, 768794, 46168, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, Lynne!</td>', 'Beautiful shot, Lynne!', '2009-03-08 09:03:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295534, 763997, 92577, '<td valign="top">I can''t understand why this didn''t do better.<br/> <br/>By comparison this excellent picture got a 6.8 and a ribbon. Maybe it''s a cultural thing.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=766056" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/995/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_766056.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/995/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_766056.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/995/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_766056.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I can''t understand why this didn''t do better. By comparison this excellent picture got a 6.8 and a ribbon. Maybe it''s a cultural thing. ', '2009-03-08 09:05:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295540, 767658, 30982, '<td valign="top">Acht.  :-)</td>', 'Acht.  :-)', '2009-03-08 09:10:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295544, 762717, 20608, '<td valign="top">subarashi.... congrats</td>', 'subarashi.... congrats', '2009-03-08 09:14:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295545, 769100, 20608, '<td valign="top">excellent work</td>', 'excellent work', '2009-03-08 09:14:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295551, 768687, 34192, '<td valign="top">I did not vote in this challenge. For what its worth, I probably would have given you a 6.  I like the depth of field, the focus is perfect, and I like the crop (I don''t mind the top of the head missing).  However, the red tones to the skin are less than pleasing and the shooting angle (down) is not pleasing.  People often shoot down at children rather than at their eye level - makes me feel like I am menacing them by standing over them as a viewer.<br/> <br/>As for DPc, to score better:  People vote higher for the whole head, they expect a plain background, they probably thought the words on the shirt distracting, and the red tone makes it seem more like a snapshot.  They like ''high-school'' portrait style here mostly, so anything that varies must be perfectly executed.<br/> <br/>Hope that helps.  You''ve got a very beautiful child with great eyes for photographing.</td>', 'I did not vote in this challenge. For what its worth, I probably would have given you a 6.  I like the depth of field, the focus is perfect, and I like the crop (I don''t mind the top of the head missing).  However, the red tones to the skin are less than pleasing and the shooting angle (down) is not pleasing.  People often shoot down at children rather than at their eye level - makes me feel like I am menacing them by standing over them as a viewer. As for DPc, to score better:  People vote higher for the whole head, they expect a plain background, they probably thought the words on the shirt distracting, and the red tone makes it seem more like a snapshot.  They like ''high-school'' portrait style here mostly, so anything that varies must be perfectly executed. Hope that helps.  You''ve got a very beautiful child with great eyes for photographing.', '2009-03-08 09:16:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295552, 765858, 20608, '<td valign="top">congrats nice shot</td>', 'congrats nice shot', '2009-03-08 09:18:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295554, 768728, 68586, '<td valign="top">Roz - congrats on your top ten !<br/> <br/>Do you hire out your more photogenic insects ?<br/> <br/> :- )</td>', 'Roz - congrats on your top ten ! Do you hire out your more photogenic insects ?  :- )', '2009-03-08 09:24:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295560, 765679, 47852, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorites in the challenge.  I like how you captured the textures of the burning match so clearly in the center of the flame.  The whisps of smoke added a nice touch around the edge.  Perhaps a few blown areas in the center and a bit of an overdone topic for the mass of voters, but I thought it was a great shot :)</td>', 'This was one of my favorites in the challenge.  I like how you captured the textures of the burning match so clearly in the center of the flame.  The whisps of smoke added a nice touch around the edge.  Perhaps a few blown areas in the center and a bit of an overdone topic for the mass of voters, but I thought it was a great shot :)', '2009-03-08 09:34:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295562, 762717, 52549, '<td valign="top">The reclining monkay is just out of this world. A most excellent image, Keith. Congratulations on the blue.</td>', 'The reclining monkay is just out of this world. A most excellent image, Keith. Congratulations on the blue.', '2009-03-08 09:36:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295564, 767658, 3746, '<td valign="top">This is actually a really great shot, you have defintely captured the feel of those 1950s shots of "UFO`s".. Has a very B-movie feel to it, one can almost hear the Theremin led soundtrack that should accompany this image..</td>', 'This is actually a really great shot, you have defintely captured the feel of those 1950s shots of "UFO`s".. Has a very B-movie feel to it, one can almost hear the Theremin led soundtrack that should accompany this image..', '2009-03-08 09:37:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295565, 769100, 52549, '<td valign="top">I''d recognize those lower arms anywhere ;-) Breathtaking image, Judi! It''s gorgeous. Huge congrats on your ribbon.</td>', 'I''d recognize those lower arms anywhere ;-) Breathtaking image, Judi! It''s gorgeous. Huge congrats on your ribbon.', '2009-03-08 09:38:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295566, 765858, 52549, '<td valign="top">Congrats, Leo! Excellent image. He has a great face, his eyes are really hypnotic.</td>', 'Congrats, Leo! Excellent image. He has a great face, his eyes are really hypnotic.', '2009-03-08 09:40:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295567, 769128, 7810, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the PB, high score and great placing for this  very  outside the box type image ... well done</td>', 'Congrats on the PB, high score and great placing for this  very  outside the box type image ... well done', '2009-03-08 09:41:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295571, 765858, 75034, '<td valign="top">Leo, I''m thrilled that you took a ribbon with this shot. If you remember back to our discussion over your entry as to weather or not you should change the boat <br/> <br/>(which is also a fantastic photo) for this photograph of Dave, I said to you that, "I not the best photographer but I know a great photo when I see it <br/> <br/>and this one of Dave is a ribbon winner!" Turns out I was right, now if I could only do that for myself :) I would finally have a ribbon of my very own. One can <br/> <br/>dream can''t he :)<br/> <br/>I had a fantastic time on the shoot and will always be there to help if you need me, thank you, your a great photographer and I''ve had the opportunity to learn so <br/> <br/>much from you in the short time we''ve been friends. You''re generous with your knowledge of photography and patient with your teaching, your truly a GREAT friend.<br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Leo, I''m thrilled that you took a ribbon with this shot. If you remember back to our discussion over your entry as to weather or not you should change the boat  (which is also a fantastic photo) for this photograph of Dave, I said to you that, "I not the best photographer but I know a great photo when I see it  and this one of Dave is a ribbon winner!" Turns out I was right, now if I could only do that for myself :) I would finally have a ribbon of my very own. One can  dream can''t he :) I had a fantastic time on the shoot and will always be there to help if you need me, thank you, your a great photographer and I''ve had the opportunity to learn so  much from you in the short time we''ve been friends. You''re generous with your knowledge of photography and patient with your teaching, your truly a GREAT friend. All the best to you and yours. MAX!', '2009-03-08 09:47:16.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
