(5295738, 768687, 43565, '<td valign="top">I did not vote on this challenge either. I would probably have given this a 4 or 5. The eyes are beautiful and sharp. However, the top of the head is cut off--which I would not have a problem with if there was not so much shirt included. The background would not have to be solid, but having each side very different is distracting. Her complexion seems too red, but if that is her natural color then I wouldn''t change it. Lighting is the hardest thing to master (I still have a long way to go), but think of the time you two can spend together while you learn! I hope we see her again!</td>', 'I did not vote on this challenge either. I would probably have given this a 4 or 5. The eyes are beautiful and sharp. However, the top of the head is cut off--which I would not have a problem with if there was not so much shirt included. The background would not have to be solid, but having each side very different is distracting. Her complexion seems too red, but if that is her natural color then I wouldn''t change it. Lighting is the hardest thing to master (I still have a long way to go), but think of the time you two can spend together while you learn! I hope we see her again!', '2009-03-08 12:03:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295740, 769063, 86447, '<td valign="top">The title makes the viewer stop and try to figure out what''s going on.  Very clever, tv.</td>', 'The title makes the viewer stop and try to figure out what''s going on.  Very clever, tv.', '2009-03-08 12:05:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295743, 768789, 86447, '<td valign="top"><br/>I like the sharpness of the cars and the colors and composition... just that woman in there, slightly OOF, gumming up the works throws me off.  :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-03-08 12:56:13.</i></td>', 'I like the sharpness of the cars and the colors and composition... just that woman in there, slightly OOF, gumming up the works throws me off.  :)', '2009-03-08 12:10:05.000000', '2009-03-08 12:56:13.000000', 0),
(5295747, 768892, 29156, '<td valign="top">frábær lýsing</td>', 'frábær lýsing', '2009-03-08 12:11:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295759, 769217, 30982, '<td valign="top">You got a 6 from me.  I agree with Judy''s comment that it''s a good honest portrait - maybe a snapshot to some but way better than the average snapshot in my opinion.  I think one of the things that may have hurt this a bit is the crop - it does seem a bit awkward somehow.  He''s not centered, his eyes aren''t "rule of thirds" (all just guidelines, but do have some merit) and it may appear better balanced if the background had been the same on both sides.  Is it a keeper?  In my book, yes.  Great smile, good eye contact, nicely real.</td>', 'You got a 6 from me.  I agree with Judy''s comment that it''s a good honest portrait - maybe a snapshot to some but way better than the average snapshot in my opinion.  I think one of the things that may have hurt this a bit is the crop - it does seem a bit awkward somehow.  He''s not centered, his eyes aren''t "rule of thirds" (all just guidelines, but do have some merit) and it may appear better balanced if the background had been the same on both sides.  Is it a keeper?  In my book, yes.  Great smile, good eye contact, nicely real.', '2009-03-08 12:27:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295765, 768605, 20748, '<td valign="top">I own the program as well, got 6 weeks into it and then lost the momentum. I think it had a lot to do with buying an old house and starting to renovate but congrats on finishing it. (10)</td>', 'I own the program as well, got 6 weeks into it and then lost the momentum. I think it had a lot to do with buying an old house and starting to renovate but congrats on finishing it. (10)', '2009-03-08 12:32:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295768, 768711, 95166, '<td valign="top">haha, this one was taken within the challenge period. The date on my camera has been corrected and it all good now. Getting a DQ is embarrassing though.</td>', 'haha, this one was taken within the challenge period. The date on my camera has been corrected and it all good now. Getting a DQ is embarrassing though.', '2009-03-08 12:40:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295784, 769100, 88136, '<td valign="top">good job judi, this is a gorgeous photo</td>', 'good job judi, this is a gorgeous photo', '2009-03-08 13:14:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295788, 765858, 41337, '<td valign="top">It''s easy to see why this did well (lighting, DOF, and that DPC sharpness) but for me this would work a lot better had you shown a little restrain and refinement in your editing like what you''ve demonstrated in the past with your other work. In terms of detail, the guy and his clothing look great (at this size anyway), but everywhere else the detail just looks like digital fuzz, a nebulous of noise/dead pixels masquerading as detail. That might work as a style but when you coupled that with the fence, which appears to be growing a colony of pixel fungus along its edges, it becomes too much. You''ve really pushed those pixels well past their breaking point. Frankly, I don''t know why you just didn''t keep the background untouched. You probably would have scored well over a 7 had you did.</td>', 'It''s easy to see why this did well (lighting, DOF, and that DPC sharpness) but for me this would work a lot better had you shown a little restrain and refinement in your editing like what you''ve demonstrated in the past with your other work. In terms of detail, the guy and his clothing look great (at this size anyway), but everywhere else the detail just looks like digital fuzz, a nebulous of noise/dead pixels masquerading as detail. That might work as a style but when you coupled that with the fence, which appears to be growing a colony of pixel fungus along its edges, it becomes too much. You''ve really pushed those pixels well past their breaking point. Frankly, I don''t know why you just didn''t keep the background untouched. You probably would have scored well over a 7 had you did.', '2009-03-08 13:17:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295790, 762717, 33068, '<td valign="top">AMAZING capture.</td>', 'AMAZING capture.', '2009-03-08 13:18:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295800, 762717, 30791, '<td valign="top">ah amazing amazing photo well deserved!</td>', 'ah amazing amazing photo well deserved!', '2009-03-08 13:33:15.000000', NULL, 0),
