(5295817, 769217, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice strong detail, sharp focus, some decent catchlights in his eyes. I''m at a loss as to how this came in so low. Maybe just too many people that felt it was a solid 5 and so the people who actually disliked it brought it down.<br/> <br/>This one did not come up for me in voting, but I think it would have probably gotten a 6 from me.</td>', 'Nice strong detail, sharp focus, some decent catchlights in his eyes. I''m at a loss as to how this came in so low. Maybe just too many people that felt it was a solid 5 and so the people who actually disliked it brought it down. This one did not come up for me in voting, but I think it would have probably gotten a 6 from me.', '2009-03-08 13:56:16.000000', NULL, 0),
