(5295841, 764899, 18197, '<td valign="top">I admire the energy of this photo. I appreciate its strong composition. And in the end, it pleases me. I understand this is not the traditional stock image, the kind that usually does well here.  But I''m sorry it didn''t achieve a higher score.</td>', 'I admire the energy of this photo. I appreciate its strong composition. And in the end, it pleases me. I understand this is not the traditional stock image, the kind that usually does well here.  But I''m sorry it didn''t achieve a higher score.', '2009-03-08 14:08:05.000000', NULL, 0),
