(5295910, 763217, 41337, '<td valign="top">Interesting presentation. Her <strike>head</strike> mind and body appear to be two separate entities, not at all physically attached. The choice comes in the willingful connection of the two as illustrated by her hands and arms holding her head in place. Had you shown more detail, such as her neck and back, the title wouldn''t work.</td>', 'Interesting presentation. Her head mind and body appear to be two separate entities, not at all physically attached. The choice comes in the willingful connection of the two as illustrated by her hands and arms holding her head in place. Had you shown more detail, such as her neck and back, the title wouldn''t work.', '2009-03-08 14:38:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295915, 768924, 30982, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, nothing wrong with it at all.  I quite like it.</td>', 'In my opinion, nothing wrong with it at all.  I quite like it.', '2009-03-08 14:40:43.000000', NULL, 0),
