(5295956, 768967, 20577, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by moolacoola:</b></div><hr/><i> Has anyone ever told you that you look like Ray Liotta? At least in this pic. Keep up the crime fighting. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Actually, I get that quite a bit.</td>', 'Originally posted by moolacoola: Has anyone ever told you that you look like Ray Liotta? At least in this pic. Keep up the crime fighting.   Actually, I get that quite a bit.', '2009-03-08 15:00:41.000000', NULL, 0),
