(5295983, 769081, 24976, '<td valign="top">good message but it would have been a stronger shot if those were real people instead of toys... thinking of how you would have shot the same scene differently maybe having a reflection of the neighborhood on the glass or reflections of people walking by, to add another layer of context to the shot. Otherwise this could as well have been a shot of some toys you had lying around in your garage.</td>', 'good message but it would have been a stronger shot if those were real people instead of toys... thinking of how you would have shot the same scene differently maybe having a reflection of the neighborhood on the glass or reflections of people walking by, to add another layer of context to the shot. Otherwise this could as well have been a shot of some toys you had lying around in your garage.', '2009-03-08 15:10:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295985, 768924, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s really different and makes me examine it a bit. My only critique may be that the centered comp makes my eye land on his tattoo and I don''t notice the gas mask for a bit. The OOF trees on the left don''t seem to add anything to the image for me.<br/> <br/>I think it did not do higher simply because it is a grim image.</td>', 'It''s really different and makes me examine it a bit. My only critique may be that the centered comp makes my eye land on his tattoo and I don''t notice the gas mask for a bit. The OOF trees on the left don''t seem to add anything to the image for me. I think it did not do higher simply because it is a grim image.', '2009-03-08 15:12:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5295999, 768924, 97166, '<td valign="top">I can''t find anything truly wrong with it, but neither can I find anything truly right with it either.  It''s a 6 image in my head, and what I would suggest is that it was simply the wrong image for a Free Study. In another context this might have stood out, but surrounded by 400+ photographs, your bell curve says everything.  It didn''t stand out for the majority of people. <br/> <br/>Sometimes that just happens for no real reason at all, especially in the Free Studies.  Our work just gets lost to the masses.<br/> <br/>Take comfort, however, in the few that enjoyed it, and 8 in-challenge comments on a mid-5 shot is a wonderful achievement.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I can''t find anything truly wrong with it, but neither can I find anything truly right with it either.  It''s a 6 image in my head, and what I would suggest is that it was simply the wrong image for a Free Study. In another context this might have stood out, but surrounded by 400+ photographs, your bell curve says everything.  It didn''t stand out for the majority of people.  Sometimes that just happens for no real reason at all, especially in the Free Studies.  Our work just gets lost to the masses. Take comfort, however, in the few that enjoyed it, and 8 in-challenge comments on a mid-5 shot is a wonderful achievement. ', '2009-03-08 15:20:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5296012, 768843, 75192, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rodfulk:</b></div><hr/><i> good night shot, what did you use for lighting? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the comment.<br/> <br/>I didn''t use any lighting, only that of the street lamps! I shot on night mode with my Canon... and it just..... came out, like this!<br/> <br/>A bit of a fluke really! <br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by rodfulk: good night shot, what did you use for lighting?   Thanks for the comment. I didn''t use any lighting, only that of the street lamps! I shot on night mode with my Canon... and it just..... came out, like this! A bit of a fluke really!  ', '2009-03-08 15:25:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5296021, 769247, 72670, '<td valign="top">I thought for sure this would fare much better. Lovely detail in this shot! I scored it an 8. No Shame in knowing that you have an excellent pic here.</td>', 'I thought for sure this would fare much better. Lovely detail in this shot! I scored it an 8. No Shame in knowing that you have an excellent pic here.', '2009-03-08 15:29:13.000000', NULL, 0),
