(5296150, 768924, 30364, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=102315" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">cytoxan</a> is quite correct; I am a lot older than you and so there''s likely to be a communication gap between us.  I gave it a 5, which is well above average for me (my average in this challenge was about 4.0 I think).  My comment during voting was that it is a nicely-made photograph but of no apparent substance beyond that.  Tattoo + armpit + gas mask ... presumably it''s a combination that must mean something?  Unless of course its point is to not have one.  Alas, nobody (including you) has given we crusty old dudes any hint as to its meaning.  Nevertheless, it was well inside my top 20% in the challenge.</td>', ' cytoxan is quite correct; I am a lot older than you and so there''s likely to be a communication gap between us.  I gave it a 5, which is well above average for me (my average in this challenge was about 4.0 I think).  My comment during voting was that it is a nicely-made photograph but of no apparent substance beyond that.  Tattoo + armpit + gas mask ... presumably it''s a combination that must mean something?  Unless of course its point is to not have one.  Alas, nobody (including you) has given we crusty old dudes any hint as to its meaning.  Nevertheless, it was well inside my top 20% in the challenge.', '2009-03-08 17:22:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5296153, 768758, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>don''t know how you did this shot, don''t want to know....<br/>This is <i>magical</i>....  :-)</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!don''t know how you did this shot, don''t want to know....This is magical....  :-)', '2009-03-08 17:23:28.000000', NULL, 0),
