(5296166, 767008, 84124, '<td valign="top">Diana, I absolutely love this shot and it was one of my favs when I went through this FS... I''d like to make a suggestion, check out this shot from Richard (Yanko).  <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=678848" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/858/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_678848.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/858/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_678848.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/858/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_678848.jpg"/></a> <br/>Richard also posted the original, so you can see what he did, he took a nice shot of two fawns and turned it into a ribbon winner with some skillful post processing.  Your shot reminds me so much of his original for that challenge, I think with some similiar post processing yours could easily be on the front page.</td>', 'Diana, I absolutely love this shot and it was one of my favs when I went through this FS... I''d like to make a suggestion, check out this shot from Richard (Yanko).   Richard also posted the original, so you can see what he did, he took a nice shot of two fawns and turned it into a ribbon winner with some skillful post processing.  Your shot reminds me so much of his original for that challenge, I think with some similiar post processing yours could easily be on the front page.', '2009-03-08 17:30:15.000000', NULL, 0),
