(5296193, 768729, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677020" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award WINNER!<br/> my comment from yesterday got eaten by the Daylight Savings Time Bug or something...<br/> <br/>I can feel the window against my head, how I am trying not to drift off to sleep and miss my stop....  The tones, textures, color are all just spot on.  The attention paid to composition here is terrific, with leading lines and corner taken-care-of.  A beautiful abstraction, a waking dream.</td>', 'PostLuminous Award WINNER! my comment from yesterday got eaten by the Daylight Savings Time Bug or something... I can feel the window against my head, how I am trying not to drift off to sleep and miss my stop....  The tones, textures, color are all just spot on.  The attention paid to composition here is terrific, with leading lines and corner taken-care-of.  A beautiful abstraction, a waking dream.', '2009-03-08 17:44:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5296197, 769141, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677020" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award WINNER!<br/>my comment from yesterday got "vanished" somehow...<br/> <br/>This is clearly technically superb.  Add in artistically superb, too.  Tones, textures, conversion, composition, reflexes on the shutter, all your choices here yield a surpassingly luminous creation that is endlessly fascinating.</td>', 'PostLuminous Award WINNER!my comment from yesterday got "vanished" somehow... This is clearly technically superb.  Add in artistically superb, too.  Tones, textures, conversion, composition, reflexes on the shutter, all your choices here yield a surpassingly luminous creation that is endlessly fascinating.', '2009-03-08 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5296198, 769084, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677020" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award WINNER!<br/>no further reason necessary than my comment below :-)<br/> <br/>and I am not justifying my audible gasps--Chromey don''t play that.... ;-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-03-08 23:35:12.</i></td>', 'PostLuminous Award WINNER!no further reason necessary than my comment below :-) and I am not justifying my audible gasps--Chromey don''t play that.... ;-)', '2009-03-08 17:47:47.000000', '2009-03-08 23:35:12.000000', 0),
(5296199, 769032, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677020" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677020.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award WINNER!<br/>spend time with this image and be rewarded!  The dark sky is not that dark after all--things are happening up there!  And there is a subtle echo there of the things that are happening below.  Well done.</td>', 'PostLuminous Award WINNER!spend time with this image and be rewarded!  The dark sky is not that dark after all--things are happening up there!  And there is a subtle echo there of the things that are happening below.  Well done.', '2009-03-08 17:49:40.000000', NULL, 0),
