(5296272, 768967, 20577, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sempermarine:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by toddhead:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by moolacoola:</b></div><hr/><i> Has anyone ever told you that you look like Ray Liotta? At least in this pic. Keep up the crime fighting. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Actually, I get that quite a bit. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I think he was referring to me. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>He said Ray Liotta, not Don Rickles.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-03-08 20:01:39.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by sempermarine: Originally posted by toddhead: Originally posted by moolacoola: Has anyone ever told you that you look like Ray Liotta? At least in this pic. Keep up the crime fighting.   Actually, I get that quite a bit.   I think he was referring to me.   He said Ray Liotta, not Don Rickles.', '2009-03-08 19:10:16.000000', '2009-03-08 20:01:39.000000', 0),
