(5296992, 767867, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good use of the track as a leading line element.  I kinda want the train a bit more toward the right edge, which to keep the curve would mean you''d have to move across the track to your left to compose the shot.  Good job with the processing - have you checked out Topaz Adjust, my latest addiction?  Free trial for 30 days!  (Then, as far as I can tell, it still work but you get a nag screen every time you fire it up.  Though that may just be the warning - not sure I''ve hit 30 days yet.)</td>', 'Very good use of the track as a leading line element.  I kinda want the train a bit more toward the right edge, which to keep the curve would mean you''d have to move across the track to your left to compose the shot.  Good job with the processing - have you checked out Topaz Adjust, my latest addiction?  Free trial for 30 days!  (Then, as far as I can tell, it still work but you get a nag screen every time you fire it up.  Though that may just be the warning - not sure I''ve hit 30 days yet.)', '2009-03-09 05:25:20.000000', NULL, 0),
