(5298468, 768809, 87808, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling that this was shot in some sort of show room, hence the red lights. It is a gorgeous bike, and you nearly got it. <br/> <br/>I would do a high pass sharpening to it, just to make it less soft, then play with the selective colours and hue and saturation . A little dodge and burn on the lights will bring it out and pop a little more too. <br/> <br/>You have it at a great angle though and it is great on the eye!</td>', 'I have a feeling that this was shot in some sort of show room, hence the red lights. It is a gorgeous bike, and you nearly got it.  I would do a high pass sharpening to it, just to make it less soft, then play with the selective colours and hue and saturation . A little dodge and burn on the lights will bring it out and pop a little more too.  You have it at a great angle though and it is great on the eye!', '2009-03-09 22:43:09.000000', NULL, 0),
