(5315457, 762717, 60224, '<td valign="top">What can I say....wow. I''d have loved to see the look on your face when you saw this group arranged this way. Especially the one lying back. It''s one of those moments when you must have thought "this is going to be a very special photo!" It''s one thing to have the skills to set up and take this great shot....but it''s another thing to be there when something special happens, such as the "pose" they struck at the right time. Magic for any photogrpher!! I am a novice, but I hope to be lucky enough to capture some great moments like this one and to do them justice like you have. It''s not just a great shot...but a great moment you''ve captured.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-03-11 22:02:46.</i></td>', 'What can I say....wow. I''d have loved to see the look on your face when you saw this group arranged this way. Especially the one lying back. It''s one of those moments when you must have thought "this is going to be a very special photo!" It''s one thing to have the skills to set up and take this great shot....but it''s another thing to be there when something special happens, such as the "pose" they struck at the right time. Magic for any photogrpher!! I am a novice, but I hope to be lucky enough to capture some great moments like this one and to do them justice like you have. It''s not just a great shot...but a great moment you''ve captured.', '2009-03-11 22:01:05.000000', '2009-03-11 22:02:46.000000', 0),
